(240,13,25,'pre',15,'Your turn · sheet 14','drawing','Look closely at the original activity sheet. You can open a larger copy.','Work through every numbered item on this sheet. Write answers with their numbers, or use the pen to mark the sheet. You can also speak an answer and check the detected text.','assets/images/level2a/page-019.webp','[\"assets/images/level2a/page-019.webp\"]','Look closely at the original activity sheet. You can open a larger copy. Work through every numbered item on this sheet. Write answers with their numbers, or use the pen to mark the sheet. You can also speak an answer and check the detected text.',NULL,10,19,'C. Directions:                   .\nListen to the teacher attentively. Follow the instructions\ncarefully . Say the new words formed.\n\n A. Delete the /s/ sound from the following words. What\n    are the new words formed?\n         fast      gust    sand     stop\n B. Delete the /d/ sound from the following words. What\n    are the new words formed?\n         stand band        card    dash\n C. Delete the /t/ sound from the following words.\n    What are the new words formed ?\n         stand    cart     train     trap\n D. Delete the /b/ sound from the following words. What\n    are the new words formed ?\n         bam     bat     bash      barks\n E. Delete the /n/sound from the following words.\n    What do you get?\n         band      rant    bend    rend',1,1,'drawing'),
(241,13,25,'pre',16,'Your turn · sheet 15','drawing','Look closely at the original activity sheet. You can open a larger copy.','Work through every numbered item on this sheet. Write answers with their numbers, or use the pen to mark the sheet. You can also speak an answer and check the detected text.','assets/images/level2a/page-020.webp','[\"assets/images/level2a/page-020.webp\"]','Look closely at the original activity sheet. You can open a larger copy. Work through every numbered item on this sheet. Write answers with their numbers, or use the pen to mark the sheet. You can also speak an answer and check the detected text.',NULL,10,20,'___\n        Phoneme                 Pretest\n        Addition\n\n  Directions: Add the correct letter sound in the\n  beginning, middle, or end of the given word to form\n  a new word. Write your answer in the box.\n      Say It          Circle It           Write the Word\n\nlap            /c//a//p/                     clap\n\nhear           /m/ /t/ /d/\n\nat             /z/ /x/ /c/\n\ntee            /t/ /d/ /g/\n\ngas            /ll/ /aa/ /ss/\n\ntick           /s/ /e/ /o/\n\npear           /t/ /l/ /a/\n\neat            /m/ /a/ /e/\n\ngapes          /s/ /r/ /k/\n\nlate           /p/ /a/ /i/\n\nbow            /l/ /o/ /a/\n\ntar            /s/ /a/ /t/',1,1,'drawing'),
(242,13,25,'pre',17,'Your turn · sheet 16','drawing','Look closely at the original activity sheet. You can open a larger copy.','Work through every numbered item on this sheet. Write answers with their numbers, or use the pen to mark the sheet. You can also speak an answer and check the detected text.','assets/images/level2a/page-021.webp','[\"assets/images/level2a/page-021.webp\"]','Look closely at the original activity sheet. You can open a larger copy. Work through every numbered item on this sheet. Write answers with their numbers, or use the pen to mark the sheet. You can also speak an answer and check the detected text.',NULL,10,21,'___\n       Phoneme                  Pretest\n      Substitution\n\n\n      Test I\n           Direction: Put check ( ) if the word s are formed\n                     by changing the initial sound and (x_) if\n                     in ending sound.\n\n\n          _____ 1.mug----------bug\n\n          _____2. mat----------man\n\n          _____3. rat-------------ran\n\n          _____4. mat------------hat\n\n          _____5.can-----------ran\n\n          _____6.bag----------tag\n\n          _____7. map----------man\n\n          _____8.rat-------------ram',1,1,'drawing'),
(243,14,NULL,'learn',1,'Let’s get ready','reference','Read or listen, then choose Next.','Say each picture name slowly. Listen for the first sound, not the letter name.',NULL,'[]','Say each picture name slowly. Listen for the first sound, not the letter name.',NULL,0,26,'Beginning / Initial Sound\n        Isolation\nMotivation:\n          Beginning             /      Initial\n  Show different pictures to the learners. Ask them\n  to tell Sound\n          the names ofIsolation\n                       the objects. LetInitial\n                                         them give\n  the sound of each object produces.\n          Sound Isolation\n\n\n  Tell to the learners that different things and\n  animals have their own different sounds.\n\n1. Developmental activities:\n\n  Show cards containing the letter and produce\n  to them the letter sound.\n\n\n       /b/ /a/                      /t/\n  Have a review on the different letter sounds\n  previously learned.\n\n3. Analysis/Discussion\n\nActivity 1. Recognizing Individual Sounds within a\nword.\nWhen we isolate the letters in a word, we can hear its\nindividual sound.',0,1,'none'),
