(303,30,NULL,'learn',1,'Let’s get ready','reference','Read or listen, then choose Next.','Say the word part. Add the sound shown to build a word.',NULL,'[]','Say the word part. Add the sound shown to build a word.',NULL,0,118,'Activity 17: Adding phoneme\n                    to the end of the word.\n\n\n1. Motivation:\n   Teacher says: Name the object and add a phoneme to form a\n   new word.\n\n                            /t/               cart\n\n  Ask the pupils what they can say.\n\n2. Developmental activities:\n\n  Have a review on phoneme deletion\n\n  Delete the /n/ sound from each word. Then write the new word.\n\n     1. bend (bed)                4. lend   (led)\n     2. cant (cat)                5. land   (lad)\n     3. rend (red)\n\n3. Analysis/Discussion\n\n  Show the picture to the pupils\n\n\n          /s/                                        snail\n\n     Ask the pupils what is the picture.\n\n     Tell them that it is a bell. If we add phoneme /s/ to the word\n     “nail” it changes the meaning of the word to “snail”\n\n     Give more examples.\n\n     Say the sound and read first: (I do)',0,1,'none'),
(304,30,NULL,'learn',2,'Your turn · sheet 1','drawing','Look closely at the original activity sheet. You can open a larger copy.','Work through every numbered item on this sheet. Write answers with their numbers, or use the pen to mark the sheet. You can also speak an answer and check the detected text.','assets/images/level2a/page-121.webp','[\"assets/images/level2a/page-121.webp\"]','Look closely at the original activity sheet. You can open a larger copy. Work through every numbered item on this sheet. Write answers with their numbers, or use the pen to mark the sheet. You can also speak an answer and check the detected text.',NULL,10,121,'4. Practice\n(Let the learners answer the activity individually or into small group.)\n\nGroup the pupils into small group. Distribute the activity sheets and\nlet them answer the activity 1. You Add Me\n\n\n\n\n                         Phoneme Addition\n                      Activity 17: YOU ADD ME\n\n  Read the word and add the phoneme in the\n  beginning, middle or end. to form a new word. Write\n  the newly form word on the space provided.\n\n\n\n                                     ten /t/\n    car /t/\n                                      __ __ __ __\n   __ __ __ __\n\n\n\n\n cap /l/                               cab /r/\n  __ __ __ __                           __ __ __ __\n\n\n\n\n     car /d/                           sick /t/\n    __ __ __ __                         __ __ __ __ __',1,1,'drawing'),
(305,30,NULL,'learn',3,'Your turn · sheet 2','drawing','Look closely at the original activity sheet. You can open a larger copy.','Work through every numbered item on this sheet. Write answers with their numbers, or use the pen to mark the sheet. You can also speak an answer and check the detected text.','assets/images/level2a/page-122.webp','[\"assets/images/level2a/page-122.webp\"]','Look closely at the original activity sheet. You can open a larger copy. Work through every numbered item on this sheet. Write answers with their numbers, or use the pen to mark the sheet. You can also speak an answer and check the detected text.',NULL,10,122,'5. Conclusion\n\n  What is Phoneme Addition?\n\n\n   Phoneme addition involves adding phonemes to a given word\nto produce a new word.\n      A phoneme can be added in the beginning, middle, or end\nto form a new word.',1,1,'drawing'),
(306,30,NULL,'learn',4,'Your turn · sheet 3','drawing','Look closely at the original activity sheet. You can open a larger copy.','Work through every numbered item on this sheet. Write answers with their numbers, or use the pen to mark the sheet. You can also speak an answer and check the detected text.','assets/images/level2a/page-123.webp','[\"assets/images/level2a/page-123.webp\"]','Look closely at the original activity sheet. You can open a larger copy. Work through every numbered item on this sheet. Write answers with their numbers, or use the pen to mark the sheet. You can also speak an answer and check the detected text.',NULL,10,123,'IV. Evaluation\n\n\n                     Phoneme Addition\n                  Activity 17: YOU LET ME IN\nAdd the phoneme to the given word to form a new\nword. Check the box of the correct answer.\n\n\n                                               farm\n                        fam /r/                cam\n\n\n\n                                               rap\n                       plan /t/\n                                               plant\n\n\n                                                for\n\n                           for /k/              fork\n\n\n\n                                               ant\n                          an /t/\n                                               arm\n\n\n\n                                               apes\n                       gapes /r/\n                                               grapes',1,1,'drawing'),
