(308,31,NULL,'learn',1,'Let’s get ready','reference','Read or listen, then choose Next.','Add the new sound at the beginning. Blend the sounds together.',NULL,'[]','Add the new sound at the beginning. Blend the sounds together.',NULL,0,125,'Activity 18: Beginning Consonant Phoneme Blending\n\n\n  1. Motivation:\n\n  Teacher says: Name the object in the picture.\n\n\n\n\n  Ask the learners to share experience that is related to the picture.\n\n  2. Developmental activities\n\n        Review:\n    Show the card to the pupils and let them say the newly formed\nwords.\n\n\n\n           far            /m/               farm\n\n\n\n           cat            / r/              cart\n\n\n\n          pain           / t/               paint\n\n\n           sick          / t/               stick\n\n\n\n\nGive more examples.',0,1,'none'),
