(435,65,NULL,'learn',1,'Meet the word family “ea” and “ai”','reference','Read or listen, then choose Next.','Look at the pictures and read their names: meal and pail.\nThey have the word family “ea” and “ai”.','assets/images/level3/l06-intro-meal.webp','[\"assets/images/level3/l06-intro-meal.webp\", \"assets/images/level3/l06-intro-pail.webp\"]','Look at the pictures and read their names: meal and pail.\nThey have the word family “ea” and “ai”.',NULL,0,43,'35\nLesson 6: Word Family “ea” and “ai”\nTeacher’s Activity:\n1. Teacher will introduce the words and show picture.\nmeal\n2. Ask the learners to read the names of the pictures\nthat contain the vowel teams “ea” and “ai.”\n3. Present the words. Read each word aloud and let\nthe learners repeat after you. Provide guidance\nand correct their pronunciation when necessary.\nmeal\nhear\nmeat\nseat\npeak\nbait\nnail\npail\ntail\nrain\n4. Word Family Station Activities\nStation 1: Word Sorting Worksheet\nSort the words into the correct word family columns.\nmeal\nrain\nbait\npail\ntail\nhear\nnail\nmeat\npeak\nseat\n/ai/\n/ ea/\npail',1,1,'none'),
