(470,70,NULL,'learn',1,'Meet the blends bl-, br-','reference','Read or listen, then choose Next.','Look at the pictures. Their names begin with the consonant blend bl- and br-.\n\nBlend the sounds:\nb + l = bl   b + r = br\n\nNow read the words:\nbl + ue = blue   br + ead = bread','assets/images/level3/l11-intro-blue.webp','[\"assets/images/level3/l11-intro-blue.webp\", \"assets/images/level3/l11-intro-bread.webp\"]','Look at the pictures. Their names begin with the consonant blend bl- and br-.\n\nBlend the sounds:\nb + l = bl   b + r = br\n\nNow read the words:\nbl + ue = blue   br + ead = bread',NULL,0,62,'54\nLesson 11: Consonant Blend br-, bl-\nTeacher’s Activity:\n1. Show pictures with consonant bl- and br-.\n2.Ask any learner/s who can blend the |bl-| and\n|br-|. If none, the teacher will demonstrate\nthe blending.\nb + l = bl\nb + r = br\n3. Ask another learner/s who can blend the\n|bl-| and |br| sounds. If no volunteer,\nthe teacher will demonstrate the activity.\nbl + ue = blue\nbr + ead = bread\n4. Teacher will let the learners read more words with |bl-|\nand |br-| blends.\n5. Proceed by doing the following activities:',1,1,'none'),
