(472,70,NULL,'learn',3,'Activity 2: Word Dart Board','group','Play this with your teacher and classmates. Choose Done when your turn is finished.','Each learner will take turns throwing a pin at the dart board and read aloud the word where the pin lands.\n\nHow to play:\n1. The teacher prepares a dart board labeled with different words.\n2. The learners form a line facing the dart board and wait for their designated turn.\n3. Each learner throws a pin toward the dart board and reads aloud the word indicated by the point where the pin lands.','assets/images/level3/l11-dartboard.webp','[\"assets/images/level3/l11-dartboard.webp\"]','Each learner will take turns throwing a pin at the dart board and read aloud the word where the pin lands.',NULL,10,64,'56\nActivity 2: Word Dart Board\nDirection: Each learner will take turns throwing a pin at the dart\nboard and read aloud the word where the pin lands.\nProcedure:\n1. The teacher prepares a dart board labeled with different words.\n2. The learners form a line facing the dart board and wait for their\ndesignated turn.\n3. Each learner throws a pin toward the dart board and reads aloud the\nword indicated by the point where the pin lands.',1,1,'perform'),
