(476,71,NULL,'learn',1,'Meet the blends cl-, cr-','reference','Read or listen, then choose Next.','Look at the pictures. Their names begin with the consonant blend cl- and cr-.\n\nBlend the sounds:\nc + l = cl   c + r = cr\n\nNow read the words:\ncl + ip = clip   cr + y = cry','assets/images/level3/l12-intro-clip.webp','[\"assets/images/level3/l12-intro-clip.webp\", \"assets/images/level3/l12-intro-cry.webp\"]','Look at the pictures. Their names begin with the consonant blend cl- and cr-.\n\nBlend the sounds:\nc + l = cl   c + r = cr\n\nNow read the words:\ncl + ip = clip   cr + y = cry',NULL,0,68,'60\n60\nLesson 12: Consonant Blend cr-, cl –\nTeacher’s Activity:\n1. Show pictures with consonant cl- and cr-.\n2. Ask any learner/s who can blend the |cl-| and |cr-|. If\nnone, the teacher will demonstrate the blending.\nc + l = cl\nc + r = cr\n3. Ask any learner/s who can blend the |cl-| and |cr-|\nsounds. If no volunteer, the teacher will\ndemonstrate the activity.\ncl + ip = clip\ncr + y = cry\n4. Teacher will let the learners read more words with |cl-\n| and |cr-| blends.\n5. Proceed by doing the following activities:',1,1,'none'),
