(478,71,NULL,'learn',3,'Activity 1: Picture Dart Board','group','Play this with your teacher and classmates. Choose Done when your turn is finished.','Throw a pin at the dart board, name the picture you hit, and tell whether it begins with the consonant blend cl- or cr-.\n\nHow to play:\n1. The teacher prepares a dart board containing different pictures that begin with consonant blends cl- and cr-.\n2. The learners fall in line facing the dart board.\n3. One learner at a time comes forward and throws a pin or dart at any picture on the board.\n4. After hitting a picture, the learner identifies the picture, says its name aloud, and tells whether the word begins with cl- or cr-.\n5. The teacher checks the answer and provides guidance or correction when necessary.','assets/images/level3/l12-dartboard.webp','[\"assets/images/level3/l12-dartboard.webp\"]','Throw a pin at the dart board, name the picture you hit, and tell whether it begins with the consonant blend cl- or cr-.',NULL,10,69,'61\n61\nActivity 1: Picture Dart Board\nDirection: Throw a pin at the dart board, name the picture you hit, and tell\nwhether it begins with the consonant blend cl- or cr-.\nProcedure:\n1. The teacher prepares a dart board containing different pictures that\nbegin with consonant blends cl- and cr-.\n2. The learner/s will fall in line facing the dart board.\n3. One learner at a time will come forward and throw a pin or dart at\nany picture on the board.\n4. After hitting a picture, the learners will:\n\nIdentify the picture.\n\nSay the name of the picture aloud.\n\nTell whether the word begins with the consonant blend\ncl- or cr-.\n5. The teacher checks the learner/s answer and provides guidance\nor correct when necessary.',1,1,'perform'),
