(484,71,41,'post',5,'Extra practice · Supplementary Activity Material 4','open','Match the pictures with the correct cl- and cr- blend. The first one has been done as an example: crab — cr.','Match the pictures with the correct cl- and cr- blend. The first one has been done as an example: crab — cr.',NULL,'[]','Match the pictures with the correct cl- and cr- blend. The first one has been done as an example: crab — cr.',NULL,10,75,'67\n67\nSupplementary Activity Material 4\nName: _____________________________________\nDirection:\nMatch the pictures with the correct cl- and cr- blend.\nThe first one has been done as an example.\nNow practice reading these words:\nclassroom\ncream\nclub\nclaw\ncrack\ncrown\ncloak\ncross\ncling\nclear\nclothes\ncrisp',1,1,'answer'),
