(486,72,NULL,'learn',1,'Meet the blends dr-','reference','Read or listen, then choose Next.','Look at the pictures. Their names begin with the consonant blend dr-.\n\nBlend the sounds:\nd + r = dr\n\nNow read the words:\ndr + one = drone','assets/images/level3/l13-intro-drone.webp','[\"assets/images/level3/l13-intro-drone.webp\"]','Look at the pictures. Their names begin with the consonant blend dr-.\n\nBlend the sounds:\nd + r = dr\n\nNow read the words:\ndr + one = drone',NULL,0,78,'70\n70\nLesson 13: Consonant Blend dr-\nTeacher’s Activity:\n1. Show pictures with consonant dr-.\n2. Ask any learner/s who can blend the |dr-|.\nIf none, the teacher will demonstrate the\nblending.\nd + r = dr\n3. Ask any learner/s who can blend the |dr-| sounds.\nIf no volunteer, the teacher will demonstrate the\nactivity.\ndr + one = drone\n4. Teacher will let the learners read more words with\n|dr-| blends.\n5. Proceed by doing the following activities:',1,1,'none'),
