(493,73,NULL,'learn',1,'Meet the blends fl-, fr-','reference','Read or listen, then choose Next.','Look at the pictures. Their names begin with the consonant blend fl- and fr-.\n\nBlend the sounds:\nf + l = fl   f + r = fr\n\nNow read the words:\nfl + ag = flag   fr + og = frog','assets/images/level3/l14-intro-flag.webp','[\"assets/images/level3/l14-intro-flag.webp\", \"assets/images/level3/l14-intro-frog.webp\"]','Look at the pictures. Their names begin with the consonant blend fl- and fr-.\n\nBlend the sounds:\nf + l = fl   f + r = fr\n\nNow read the words:\nfl + ag = flag   fr + og = frog',NULL,0,85,'77\n77\nLesson 14: Consonant Blend fr-, fl-\nTeacher’s Activity:\n1.Show pictures with consonant fl- and fr-.\n2. Ask any learner/s who can blend the |fl-| and |fr-|.\nIf none, the teacher will demonstrate the blending.\nf + l = fl\nf + r = fr\n3. Ask\nany\nlearner/s who can blend the |fl-| and |fr-| sounds. If\nno volunteer, the teacher will demonstrate the\nactivity.\nfl + ag = flag\nfr + og = frog\n4. Teacher will let the learners read more words with\n|fl-| and |fr-| blends.\n5. Proceed by doing the following activities:',1,1,'none'),
