(495,73,NULL,'learn',3,'Activity 1: Color My Word and Read Me!','open','Choose the word or words in each row that begin with the fl- or fr- sound, and read them.','Choose the word or words in each row that begin with the fl- or fr- sound, and read them.',NULL,'[]','Choose the word or words in each row that begin with the fl- or fr- sound, and read them.',NULL,10,86,'78\n78\nActivity 1: Color My Word and Read Me!\nDirection: Color the word/s in each row that begins with fl- or fr-\nsound and read them.\n1.\nflag\nbag\nrag\n2.\nfrog\nlog\nfrom\n3.\ncute\nmute\nflute\n4.\nfree\ntree\nbee\n5.\nslash\ncash\nflash\n6.\nframe\ngame\nname\n7.\ntip\nsip\nflip\n8.\nfresh\nmesh\nflesh\n9.\nflower\ntower\npower\n10.\nlost\ncost\nfrost',1,1,'answer'),
