(497,73,NULL,'learn',5,'Activity 3: Word Pick and Tell','group','Play this with your teacher and classmates. Choose Done when your turn is finished.','Pick a word from the basket, sound out the beginning blend (fl- or fr-), and read the whole word aloud.\n\nHow to play:\n1. The teacher displays a basket containing word cards with fl- and fr- blends (e.g., fruits, frost, fries, floor, flower, flame).\n2. Learners form a line and take turns selecting one word card from the basket.\n3. Each learner sounds out the blend (fl- or fr-) and then blends it with the rest of the word.\n4. A learner may ask a classmate for help; if no one can help, the teacher guides them.','assets/images/level3/l14-basket.webp','[\"assets/images/level3/l14-basket.webp\"]','Pick a word from the basket, sound out the beginning blend (fl- or fr-), and read the whole word aloud.',NULL,10,88,'80\n80\nActivity 3: Word Pick and Tell\nDirection: Pick a word from the basket, sound out the beginning blend (fl-\nor fr-), and read the whole word aloud.\nProcedure:\n1. The teacher displays a basket on the board containing word cards with\nfl- and fr- consonant blends (e.g., fruits, frost, fries, floor, flower, flame).\n2. Learners form a line and take turns selecting one word card from the\nbasket.\n3. Each learner reads the word by first sounding out the consonant blend\n(fl- or fr-) and then blending it with the rest of the word.\n4. If a learner has difficulty, they may ask a classmate for assistance; if no\none can help, the teacher will guide them in reading the word correctly.',1,1,'perform'),
