(510,74,44,'post',4,'Extra practice · Supplementary Activity Material 3','open','Match the pictures with the correct gl- and gr- blend. The first one has been done as an example: glue — gl.','Match the pictures with the correct gl- and gr- blend. The first one has been done as an example: glue — gl.',NULL,'[]','Match the pictures with the correct gl- and gr- blend. The first one has been done as an example: glue — gl.',NULL,10,102,'94\n94\nSupplementary Activity Material 3\nName: _____________________________________\nDirection:\nMatch the pictures with the correct cl- and cr- blend.\nThe first one has been done as an example.\nNow practice reading these words:\ngrammar\ngrocery\nglad\ngrade\ngroup\ngreetings\nglow\nglory\ngladiator\ngreen\nglobe\ngrey',1,1,'answer'),
