(512,75,NULL,'learn',1,'Meet the blends pl-, pr-','reference','Read or listen, then choose Next.','Look at the pictures. Their names begin with the consonant blend pl- and pr-.\n\nBlend the sounds:\np + l = pl   p + r = pr\n\nNow read the words:\npl + ane = plane   pr + ay = pray','assets/images/level3/l16-intro-plane.webp','[\"assets/images/level3/l16-intro-plane.webp\", \"assets/images/level3/l16-intro-pray.webp\"]','Look at the pictures. Their names begin with the consonant blend pl- and pr-.\n\nBlend the sounds:\np + l = pl   p + r = pr\n\nNow read the words:\npl + ane = plane   pr + ay = pray',NULL,0,105,'97\n97\nLesson 16: Consonant Blend pl-, pr-\nTeacher’s Activity:\n1. Show pictures with consonant pl- and pr-.\n2.Ask any learner/s who can blend the |pl-| and\n|pr-|.If none, the teacher will demonstrate the\nblending.\np + l = pl\np + r = pr\n3.Ask any learner/s who can blend the |pl-| and |pr-|\nsounds. If no volunteer, the teacher will demonstrate\nthe activity.\npl + ane = plane\npr + ay = pray\n4.Teacher will let the learners read more words\nwith |pl-| and |pr-| blends.\n5. Proceed by doing the following activities:',1,1,'none'),
