(514,75,NULL,'learn',3,'Activity 2: Word Dart Board','group','Play this with your teacher and classmates. Choose Done when your turn is finished.','Throw a dart at the board, read the word it lands on, and say it clearly.\n\nHow to play:\n1. The teacher prepares a dartboard with different words on it.\n2. The learners line up in front of the dartboard.\n3. Each learner takes a turn to throw a dart.\n4. The learner reads the word where the dart lands.\n5. The class listens and gives a clap after each turn.','assets/images/level3/l16-dartboard.webp','[\"assets/images/level3/l16-dartboard.webp\"]','Throw a dart at the board, read the word it lands on, and say it clearly.',NULL,10,107,'99\n99\nActivity 2: Word Dart Board\nDirection: Throw a dart at the board, read the word it lands on, and\nsay it clearly.\nProcedure:\n1.\nThe teacher prepares a dartboard with different words on it.\n2.\nThe learners line up in front of the dartboard.\n3.\nEach learner takes a turn to throw a dart.\n4.\nThe learner reads the word where the dart lands.\n5.\nThe class listens and gives a clap after each turn.',1,1,'perform'),
