(518,76,NULL,'learn',1,'Meet the blends st-, str-','reference','Read or listen, then choose Next.','Look at the pictures. Their names begin with the consonant blend st- and str-.\n\nBlend the sounds:\ns + t = st   st + r = str\n\nNow read the words:\nst + ar = star   str + aw = straw','assets/images/level3/l17-intro-star.webp','[\"assets/images/level3/l17-intro-star.webp\", \"assets/images/level3/l17-intro-straw.webp\"]','Look at the pictures. Their names begin with the consonant blend st- and str-.\n\nBlend the sounds:\ns + t = st   st + r = str\n\nNow read the words:\nst + ar = star   str + aw = straw',NULL,0,111,'103\n103\nLesson 17: Consonant Blend st-, str-\nTeacher’s Activity:\n1. Show pictures with consonant st- and str-.\n2. Ask any learner/s who can blend the |st-| and\n|str-|.If none, the teacher will demonstrate the blending.\ns + t = st\nst + r = str\n3. Ask any learner/s who can blend the |st-| and |str-|\nsounds. If no volunteer, the teacher will demonstrate\nthe activity.\nst + ar = star\nstr + aw = straw\n4. Teacher will let the learners read more words with\n|st-| and |str-| blends.\n5. Proceed by doing the following activities:',1,1,'none'),
(519,76,NULL,'learn',2,'Activity 1: Picture Dart Board','group','Play this with your teacher and classmates. Choose Done when your turn is finished.','Throw a dart, name the picture, and say if it starts with st- or str-.\n\nHow to play:\n1. The teacher prepares a dartboard with pictures on it.\n2. The learners line up in front of the dartboard.\n3. Each learner takes a turn to throw a dart.\n4. The learner looks at the picture and says its name.\n5. The learner tells if the word starts with st- or str-.\n6. The class listens and claps after each turn.','assets/images/level3/l17-dartboard.webp','[\"assets/images/level3/l17-dartboard.webp\"]','Throw a dart, name the picture, and say if it starts with st- or str-.',NULL,10,112,'104\n104\nActivity 1: Picture Dart Board\nDirection: Throw a dart, name the picture, and say if it starts with st- or str-.\nProcedure:\n1. The teacher prepares a dartboard with pictures on it.\n2. The learners line up in front of the dartboard.\n3. Each learner takes a turn to throw a dart.\n4. The learner looks at the picture and says its name.\n5. The learner tells if the word starts with st- or str-.\n6. The class listens and claps after each turn.',1,1,'perform'),
