(528,78,NULL,'learn',1,'Meet the blends sp-, spr-, spl-','reference','Read or listen, then choose Next.','Look at the pictures. Their names begin with the consonant blend sp- and spr- and spl-.\n\nBlend the sounds:\ns + p = sp   s + p + r = spr   s + p + l = spl\n\nNow read the words:\nsp + ider = spider   spr + ay = spray   spl + ash = splash','assets/images/level3/l19-intro-spider.webp','[\"assets/images/level3/l19-intro-spider.webp\", \"assets/images/level3/l19-intro-spray.webp\", \"assets/images/level3/l19-intro-splash.webp\"]','Look at the pictures. Their names begin with the consonant blend sp- and spr- and spl-.\n\nBlend the sounds:\ns + p = sp   s + p + r = spr   s + p + l = spl\n\nNow read the words:\nsp + ider = spider   spr + ay = spray   spl + ash = splash',NULL,0,122,'114\n114\nLesson 19: Consonant Blend sp-, spr- and spl-\nTeacher’s Activity:\n1. Show pictures with consonant sp-, spr- and spl-.\n\\\n2. Ask any learner/s who can blend the |sp-|, |spr-| and\n|spl-|. If none, the teacher will demonstrate the\nblending.\ns + p = sp\ns + p + r = spr\ns + p + l = spl\n3. Ask any learner/s who can blend the |sp-|, |spr-|\nand |spl-| sounds. If no volunteer, the teacher will\ndemonstrate the activity.\nsp + ider = spider\nspr + ay = spray\nspl + ash = splash\n4. Teacher will let the learners read more words with\n|sp-|, |spr-| and |spl-| blends.\n5. Proceed by doing the following activities:',1,1,'none'),
