(530,78,NULL,'learn',3,'Activity 2: Word Pick and Tell','group','Play this with your teacher and classmates. Choose Done when your turn is finished.','Pick a word, say the beginning blend, and read the whole word.\n\nHow to play:\n1. The teacher prepares a basket with words that have sp-, spr- and spl- blends.\n2. The learners line up in front of the board.\n3. Each learner takes a turn to pick one word from the basket.\n4. The learner sounds out the beginning blend and reads the whole word.\n5. If the learner needs help, a classmate or the teacher can assist.\n6. The class listens and claps after each turn.','assets/images/level3/l19-basket.webp','[\"assets/images/level3/l19-basket.webp\"]','Pick a word, say the beginning blend, and read the whole word.',NULL,10,124,'116\n116\nActivity 2: Word Pick and Tell\nDirection: Pick a word, say the beginning blend, and read the whole word.\nProcedure:\n1. The teacher prepares a basket on the board with words that have sp-,\nspr-, and spl- blends.\n2. The learners line up in front of the board.\n3. Each learners takes a turn to pick one word from the basket.\n4. The learner sounds out the beginning blend and reads the whole word.\n5. If the learner needs help, a classmate or the teacher can assist.\n6. The class listens and claps after each turn.',1,1,'perform'),
(531,78,48,'post',1,'Assessment: Individual Reading','reading','Read the following words correctly.','spear   sprite   spoon   sprain   spider   spring   sponge   spray   spaghetti   sprinkle   splash   split',NULL,'[]','Read the following words correctly.','spear   sprite   spoon   sprain   spider   spring   sponge   spray   spaghetti   sprinkle   splash   split',10,125,'117\n117\nAssessment (Individual Reading) (To be done until the end of\nthe allotted time. Can also be given to learners for home\nreading).\nDirection: Read the following words correctly.',1,1,'answer'),
(532,79,NULL,'learn',1,'Meet the blends tr-','reference','Read or listen, then choose Next.','Look at the pictures. Their names begin with the consonant blend tr-.\n\nBlend the sounds:\nt + r = tr\n\nNow read the words:\ntr + ain = train','assets/images/level3/l20-intro-train.webp','[\"assets/images/level3/l20-intro-train.webp\"]','Look at the pictures. Their names begin with the consonant blend tr-.\n\nBlend the sounds:\nt + r = tr\n\nNow read the words:\ntr + ain = train',NULL,0,126,'118\n118\nLesson 20: Consonant Blend tr-\nTeacher’s Activity:\n1. Show pictures with consonant tr-.\n2. Ask any learner/s who can blend the |tr-|.\nIf none, the teacher will demonstrate the blending.\nt + r = tr\n3. Ask any learner/s who can blend the |tr-| sounds. If\nno volunteer, the teacher will demonstrate the\nactivity.\ntr + ain = train\n4. Teacher will let the learners read more words with\n|tr-| blends.\n5. Proceed by doing the following activities:',1,1,'none'),
