(534,79,NULL,'learn',3,'Activity 2: Grab and Read!','group','Play this with your teacher and classmates. Choose Done when your turn is finished.','Pick a shirt, say “I love this shirt,” and read the word on it aloud.\n\nHow to play:\n1. The teacher posts a clothesline with shirts on the board.\n2. The learners line up in front of the board.\n3. Each learner picks a shirt and says, “I love this shirt!”\n4. The teacher asks the learner to read the word on the shirt aloud.\n5. If the learner needs help, a classmate or the teacher can assist.\n6. The class listens and claps after each turn.','assets/images/level3/l20-shirts.webp','[\"assets/images/level3/l20-shirts.webp\"]','Pick a shirt, say “I love this shirt,” and read the word on it aloud.',NULL,10,128,'120\n120\nActivity 2: Grab and Read!\nDirection: Pick a shirt, say “I love this shirt,” and read the word on it aloud.\nProcedure:\n1. The teacher posts a clothesline with shirts on the board.\n2. The learners line up in front of the board.\n3. Each learner takes a turn to pick a shirt and the learner says, “I love this\nshirt!”.\n4. The teacher asks the learner to read the word on the shirt aloud.\n5. If the learner needs help, a classmate or the teacher can assist.\n6. The class listens and claps after each turn.',1,1,'perform'),
