(556,84,NULL,'learn',1,'Meet the sight words','reference','Read or listen, then choose Next.','These are 10 difficult words to read from Fry’s 5th 100 list:\nalready   certain   early   family   mountain   sentence   special   sure   toward   usually\n\nFirst, review the words you learned before.',NULL,'[]','These are 10 difficult words to read from Fry’s 5th 100 list:\nalready   certain   early   family   mountain   sentence   special   sure   toward   usually\n\nFirst, review the words you learned before.',NULL,0,138,'130\n130\nLesson 25: Basic Sight Words (10 Difficult Words to Read from Fry’s 5th\n100 Lists)\nList of words:\nalready, certain, early, family, mountain, sentence, special, sure,\ntoward, usually\nPreliminaries: Review the words previously learned.\nActivity 1: Sight Words Hunting\nDirection: Learners will take turns selecting a leaf from the Word Hunt Table and\nread aloud the word written on it.\nProcedure:\n1. The teacher prepares the Word Hunt Table and posts it on the board,\nensuring that the target words are written on the leaf.\n2. Learners will form a line in front of the board and take turns finding or\nhunting a word from the leaf.\n3. After selecting, the learner will read aloud the word he/she has found.\nM\nO\nU\nN\nT\nA\nI\nN\nS\nC\nL\nK\nM\nX\nL\nT\nS\nE\nE\nA\nR\nL\nY\nR\nO\nP\nN\nR\nB\nS\nU\nR\nE\nW\nE\nT\nT\nT\nY\nU\nP\nA\nA\nC\nE\nA\nW\nR\nT\nW\nD\nR\nI\nN\nI\nN\nM\nK\nB\nY\nD\nA\nC\nN\nF\nA\nM\nI\nL\nY\nL\nE\nU\nS\nU\nA\nL\nL\nY\nT\nY',1,1,'none'),
(557,84,NULL,'learn',2,'Activity 1: Sight Words Hunting','group','Play this with your teacher and classmates. Choose Done when your turn is finished.','Take turns selecting a leaf from the Word Hunt Table and read aloud the word written on it. You can also hunt for the words in the letter grid.\n\nHow to play:\n1. The teacher prepares the Word Hunt Table and posts it on the board, with the target words written on the leaf.\n2. Learners form a line in front of the board and take turns finding or hunting a word from the leaf.\n3. After selecting, the learner reads aloud the word he or she has found.','assets/images/level3/l25-word-hunt.webp','[\"assets/images/level3/l25-word-hunt.webp\", \"assets/images/level3/l25-leaf.webp\"]','Take turns selecting a leaf from the Word Hunt Table and read aloud the word written on it. You can also hunt for the words in the letter grid.',NULL,10,139,'131\n131\nActivity 2: Reading Phrases\n1. already finished work\n2. certain answer\n3. early morning\n4. family dinner\n5. special gift\nActivity 2: Reading Phrases\n1. already sure\n2. towards the mountain\n3. special family\n4. early today\n5. usually certain\nActivity 3: Reading Simple Sentences\n1. She already knows the way.\n2. I am certain this is right.\n3. We woke up early today.\n4. The family went to the park.\n5. He climbed the mountain with friends.',1,1,'perform'),
