udent \nHe is a Doctor \nAnd \nShe is intelligent \nThis is the future \nThat we\'re building \nHere today \nWhole world \nThey will be amazed \nYeah \nI am \nYou are \nHe is third Person \nShe is \nIt is \nWe are awesome \nYou are \nThey are \nsubject pronouns \nWith the verb to be \nWell this is the \nVerb to be \nAnd my friend \nYou\'re on your way \n \nTypes of Mis-\ncues \nMispronun-\nciation \nOmis-\nsion \nSubsti-\ntution \nInser-\ntion \nRepe-\ntition \nTranspo-\nsition \nRever-\nsal \nTotal \nNumber of \nMiscues \nNumber of Words in the Passage \n98 \nOral Reading Score = 98 __________ / 98 X 100 \nReading YLeovue\'lll(Isndh-o98w-1t0h0,eIns-90-96, Frus– 89 below) \nReading Speed = Words Read/Reading time in seconds X 60 \nwords per Minute \n \nhttp://www.thatenglishsite.com/uploads/5/2/3/8/52383131/published/be-verb.jpg?1566744168',1,1,'answer'),
