 Tools” This is our tools. We have\nshovel and rake. We have to take care of our tools. Tools\nare very important for us. What is the main idea of the\nstory?\na. Tools are fun\nb. Tools are useful and we should take care of\nthem\nc. Tools are expensive\n2. (Read Aloud) “My Toys” These are my toys. My mother\nand father gives it to me! I can name my favorite toys. “My\nparents gave me something I can throw and catch. It’s\nround and bouncy. What is it?”\na. Kite\nb. Ball\nc. Doll\nd. Teddy Bear',1,1,'answer'),
