(760,183,NULL,'learn',1,'Listen: Trees','reference','Listen as the page is read aloud. Look at the pictures and say the words.','Activity 4-\nActivity 4- Trees\nTrees are everywhere.\nThey give us clean and fresh air.\nLittle birds live up there.\nTrees are their shelter.\nacacia\nnarra\ngolden tree\nmabolo\nkamagong\nPine tree\nfalcata\ngemilina\nbalete','assets/images/level5/g2/p025-7.webp','[\"assets/images/level5/g2/p025-7.webp\", \"assets/images/level5/g2/p025-1.webp\", \"assets/images/level5/g2/p025-2.webp\", \"assets/images/level5/g2/p025-4.webp\", \"assets/images/level5/g2/p025-3.webp\", \"assets/images/level5/g2/p025-5.webp\", \"assets/images/level5/g2/p025-6.webp\"]','Activity 4- Activity 4- Trees Trees are everywhere. They give us clean and fresh air. Little birds live up there. Trees are their shelter. acacia narra golden tree mabolo kamagong Pine tree falcata gemilina balete',NULL,5,25,'Activity 4-\nActivity 4- Trees\nTrees are everywhere.\nThey give us clean and fresh air.\nLittle birds live up there.\nTrees are their shelter.\nacacia\nnarra\ngolden tree\nmabolo\nkamagong\nPine tree\nfalcata\ngemilina\nbalete',1,1,'none'),
