(765,185,NULL,'learn',2,'Listen: Animals in the Grassland','reference','Listen as the page is read aloud. Look at the pictures and say the words.','Activity 6- Animals in the Land\nThe horse, cow and carabao.\nGo walk and walk going to the barn.\nThe dog says aww! aww! aww!\nAnd the cat says meow! meow! meow!\nUntil they meet little turkey\nand together, they play.\nCat\ncow\ndog\nhorse\ngoat\ncarabao\nChicken\npig\nturkey','assets/images/level5/g2/p030-3.webp','[\"assets/images/level5/g2/p030-3.webp\", \"assets/images/level5/g2/p030-2.webp\", \"assets/images/level5/g2/p030-1.webp\", \"assets/images/level5/g2/p030-5.webp\", \"assets/images/level5/g2/p030-4.webp\"]','Activity 6- Animals in the Land The horse, cow and carabao. Go walk and walk going to the barn. The dog says aww! aww! aww! And the cat says meow! meow! meow! Until they meet little turkey and together, they play. Cat cow dog horse goat carabao Chicken pig turkey',NULL,5,30,'Activity 6- Animals in the Land\nThe horse, cow and carabao.\nGo walk and walk going to the barn.\nThe dog says aww! aww! aww!\nAnd the cat says meow! meow! meow!\nUntil they meet little turkey\nand together, they play.\nCat\ncow\ndog\nhorse\ngoat\ncarabao\nChicken\npig\nturkey',1,1,'none'),
