\n4. snake\nsnake /\nfox /\neagle\n5. bat\nbat /\nlion /\nfox\n6. eagle\neagle /\nwild boar /\nmonkey\n7. lion\nlion /\nfox /\nsnake\n8. fox\nfox /\neagle /\nbat\nPart 2: Listening Comprehension Questions\nDirections: Listen to the story and answer the questions.\n1. Who is teasing you and me?\na)\na) Monkey b) Deer c) Kangaroo\n2. Which animals are hiding?\na)\na) Deer and kangaroo’ b) Monkey andlion c) Eagle and fox\n3. Which animals did you hear in the story? Circle all that apply.\nmonkey, deer, kangaroo, snake, bat, eagle, lion, fox, wild boar\nPart 3: Fillin the Blanks\nDirections: Fill in the missing words from the story.\nLook at the ______\n.\nhRWN =\nTeasing and me.\nLook at the and the ;\nThey are hiding on ______\n.',1,1,'answer'),
(773,189,NULL,'learn',1,'Listen: Animals in the Sea','reference','Listen as the page is read aloud. Look at the pictures and say the words.','Activity 10- Animals in the Sea\nAnimals in the Sea\nThe fish in the sea.\nGo swimming and swimming.\nUnder the deep blue sea.\nDolphins and whales are friends of me.\nshark\nwhale\ndolphin\nlobster\nsquid\ncrab\nstarfish\nshrimps\nshells','assets/images/level5/g2/p038-1.webp','[\"assets/images/level5/g2/p038-1.webp\", \"assets/images/level5/g2/p038-2.webp\", \"assets/images/level5/g2/p038-3.webp\"]','Activity 10- Animals in the Sea Animals in the Sea The fish in the sea. Go swimming and swimming. Under the deep blue sea. Dolphins and whales are friends of me. shark whale dolphin lobster squid crab starfish shrimps shells',NULL,5,38,'Activity 10- Animals in the Sea\nAnimals in the Sea\nThe fish in the sea.\nGo swimming and swimming.\nUnder the deep blue sea.\nDolphins and whales are friends of me.\nshark\nwhale\ndolphin\nlobster\nsquid\ncrab\nstarfish\nshrimps\nshells',1,1,'none'),
