(775,190,NULL,'learn',1,'Listen: Things Found in the Kitchen','reference','Listen as the page is read aloud. Look at the pictures and say the words.','Me and Our House\nCome and go with me to our house and see.\nHere is our kitchen where mama cooks for me.\nHere is our living room where | watch television.\nHere is our bathroom inside my room.\nHere is the garage where my daday fixes the\ncar for our family.','assets/images/level5/g2/p040-1.webp','[\"assets/images/level5/g2/p040-1.webp\"]','Me and Our House Come and go with me to our house and see. Here is our kitchen where mama cooks for me. Here is our living room where | watch television. Here is our bathroom inside my room. Here is the garage where my daday fixes the car for our family.',NULL,5,40,'Me and Our House\nCome and go with me to our house and see.\nHere is our kitchen where mama cooks for me.\nHere is our living room where | watch television.\nHere is our bathroom inside my room.\nHere is the garage where my daday fixes the\ncar for our family.',1,1,'none'),
(776,190,NULL,'learn',2,'Listen: Things Found in the Kitchen','reference','Listen as the page is read aloud. Look at the pictures and say the words.','Activity 11- Things Found in the Kitchen\nThings Found in the Kitchen\nKeep our kitchen clean.\nWipe the spill water and drain.\nPut fruit on your blender.\nPrepare juice and share.\nwash basin\nkettle\nrefrigerator\ngas stove\nrice cooker\nblender\nplate\nSpoon\nfork','assets/images/level5/g2/p041-1.webp','[\"assets/images/level5/g2/p041-1.webp\", \"assets/images/level5/g2/p041-2.webp\", \"assets/images/level5/g2/p041-4.webp\", \"assets/images/level5/g2/p041-3.webp\", \"assets/images/level5/g2/p041-5.webp\", \"assets/images/level5/g2/p041-7.webp\", \"assets/images/level5/g2/p041-6.webp\"]','Activity 11- Things Found in the Kitchen Things Found in the Kitchen Keep our kitchen clean. Wipe the spill water and drain. Put fruit on your blender. Prepare juice and share. wash basin kettle refrigerator gas stove rice cooker blender plate Spoon fork',NULL,5,41,'Activity 11- Things Found in the Kitchen\nThings Found in the Kitchen\nKeep our kitchen clean.\nWipe the spill water and drain.\nPut fruit on your blender.\nPrepare juice and share.\nwash basin\nkettle\nrefrigerator\ngas stove\nrice cooker\nblender\nplate\nSpoon\nfork',1,1,'none'),
(777,190,NULL,'learn',3,'Things Found in the Kitchen · page 1','open','Listen and look at the page. Type or say your answers with their numbers, for example 1-b, 2-a.','Formative Assessment – Grade 2\nActivity 11: Things Found in the Kitchen\nPart I: Vocabulary (5 items)\nDirections: Read the sentence carefully. Choose the correct meaning or\nword that fits.\nWe use a blender to:\na) Wash plates b) Make juice or mix fruits c) Cook rice\nA refrigerator is used to:\nb) Fry vegetables\na) Keep food cold __ b) Fry vegetables c) Hold water\nWe use a fork to:\na)\nc) Drink juice\na) Eat food b) Cook food on the stove c) Drink juice\nA kettle is used to:\na) Boil water\nb) Blend fruits\na) Boil water b) Blend fruits c) Wash dishes\n5. A gas stove is used to:\na) Cook food with heat bb) Store vegetables’ c) Eat food\nPart II: Listening Comprehension (5 items)\nDirections: Listen carefully as your teacher reads the passage below. Then\nchoose the correct answer.\nTeacher reads:\n“In the kitchen, we must keep everything clean. Wipe spills and drain water.\nPut fruits in the blender to make juice. Use the rice cooker to cook rice and\nthe stove to cook vegetables. Plates, spoons, and forks are for eating.”\n6. What should we do if water spills in the kitchen?\na) Ignore it\nb) Wipe it and drain\nc) Pour more water\n7. What do we put in the blender?\na) Vegetables only\nb) Fruits\nc) Plates\n8. Which kitchen tool is used to cook rice?\na) Blender\nb) Rice cooker\nc) Kettle\n9. What do we use to eat food?\na) Plate, fork, spoon\nb) Blender\nc) Stove\n10. What should we do in the kitchen to stay safe and clean?\na) Keep it clean and organized\nb) Leave food everywhere\nc) Only cook, no cleaning',NULL,'[]','Formative Assessment – Grade 2 Activity 11: Things Found in the Kitchen Part I: Vocabulary (5 items) Directions: Read the sentence carefully. Choose the correct meaning or word that fits. We use a blender to: a) Wash plates b) Make juice or mix fruits c) Cook rice A refrigerator is used to: b) Fry vegetables a) Keep food cold blank b) Fry vegetables c) Hold water We use a fork to: a) c) Drink juice a) Eat food b) Cook food on the stove c) Drink juice A kettle is used to: a) Boil water b) Blend fruits a) Boil water b) Blend fruits c) Wash dishes 5. A gas stove is used to: a) Cook food with heat bb) Store vegetables’ c) Eat food Part II: Listening Comprehension (5 items) Directions: Listen carefully as your teacher reads the passage below. Then choose the correct answer. Teacher reads: “In the kitchen, we must keep everything clean. Wipe spills and drain water. Put fruits in the blender to make juice. Use the rice cooker to cook rice and the stove to cook vegetables. Plates, spoons, and forks are for eating.” 6. What should we do if water spills in the kitchen? a) Ignore it b) Wipe it and drain c) Pour more water 7. What do we put in the blender? a) Vegetables only b) Fruits c) Plates 8. Which kitchen tool is used to cook rice? a) Blender b) Rice cooker c) Kettle 9. What do we use to eat food? a) Plate, fork, spoon b) Blender c) Stove 10. What should we do in the kitchen to stay safe and clean? a) Keep it clean and organized b) Leave food everywhere c) Only cook, no cleaning',NULL,10,42,'Formative Assessment – Grade 2\nActivity 11: Things Found in the Kitchen\nPart I: Vocabulary (5 items)\nDirections: Read the sentence carefully. Choose the correct meaning or\nword that fits.\nWe use a blender to:\na) Wash plates b) Make juice or mix fruits c) Cook rice\nA refrigerator is used to:\nb) Fry vegetables\na) Keep food cold __ b) Fry vegetables c) Hold water\nWe use a fork to:\na)\nc) Drink juice\na) Eat food b) Cook food on the stove c) Drink juice\nA kettle is used to:\na) Boil water\nb) Blend fruits\na) Boil water b) Blend fruits c) Wash dishes\n5. A gas stove is used to:\na) Cook food with heat bb) Store vegetables’ c) Eat food\nPart II: Listening Comprehension (5 items)\nDirections: Listen carefully as your teacher reads the passage below. Then\nchoose the correct answer.\nTeacher reads:\n“In the kitchen, we must keep everything clean. Wipe spills and drain water.\nPut fruits in the blender to make juice. Use the rice cooker to cook rice and\nthe stove to cook vegetables. Plates, spoons, and forks are for eating.”\n6. What should we do if water spills in the kitchen?\na) Ignore it\nb) Wipe it and drain\nc) Pour more water\n7. What do we put in the blender?\na) Vegetables only\nb) Fruits\nc) Plates\n8. Which kitchen tool is used to cook rice?\na) Blender\nb) Rice cooker\nc) Kettle\n9. What do we use to eat food?\na) Plate, fork, spoon\nb) Blender\nc) Stove\n10. What should we do in the kitchen to stay safe and clean?\na) Keep it clean and organized\nb) Leave food everywhere\nc) Only cook, no cleaning',1,1,'answer'),
