(812,202,74,'pre',6,'Pre-test · page 6','open','Listen and look at the page. Type or say your answers with their numbers, for example 1-b, 2-a.','______ 41. Who is older, Victor or Nora?\na. Nora\nb. Victor\nc. Cannot be determined\n______ 42. How many kinds of animals do they have?\na. 3\nb. 4\nc. 5\n______ 43. Which one do they NOT have?\na. cow\nb. horse\nc. carabao\n______ 44. Who takes care of the horse?\na. Victor\nb. Father\nc. Mother\n______ 45. Who takes care of the carabao?\na. Nora\nb. Victor\nc. Father\n______ 46. Who takes care of the chickens?\na. Nora\nb. Victor\nc. Mother\n______ 47. Which one does Nora take care of?\na. goat\nb. chickens\nc. carabao\nSection 2: Vocabulary\n______ 48. In \"The Story of the First Thanksgiving,\" what does the word harvest mean?\na) a big ship\nb) the food that is gathered from crops\nc) a type of celebration\nd) a difficult time\n______ 49. In \"The Little Seed\'s Journey,\" what does the word nectar mean?\na) a sweet liquid found in flowers',NULL,'[]','blank 41. Who is older, Victor or Nora? a. Nora b. Victor c. Cannot be determined blank 42. How many kinds of animals do they have? a. 3 b. 4 c. 5 blank 43. Which one do they NOT have? a. cow b. horse c. carabao blank 44. Who takes care of the horse? a. Victor b. Father c. Mother blank 45. Who takes care of the carabao? a. Nora b. Victor c. Father blank 46. Who takes care of the chickens? a. Nora b. Victor c. Mother blank 47. Which one does Nora take care of? a. goat b. chickens c. carabao Section 2: Vocabulary blank 48. In \"The Story of the First Thanksgiving,\" what does the word harvest mean? a) a big ship b) the food that is gathered from crops c) a type of celebration d) a difficult time blank 49. In \"The Little Seed\'s Journey,\" what does the word nectar mean? a) a sweet liquid found in flowers',NULL,10,11,'______ 41. Who is older, Victor or Nora?\na. Nora\nb. Victor\nc. Cannot be determined\n______ 42. How many kinds of animals do they have?\na. 3\nb. 4\nc. 5\n______ 43. Which one do they NOT have?\na. cow\nb. horse\nc. carabao\n______ 44. Who takes care of the horse?\na. Victor\nb. Father\nc. Mother\n______ 45. Who takes care of the carabao?\na. Nora\nb. Victor\nc. Father\n______ 46. Who takes care of the chickens?\na. Nora\nb. Victor\nc. Mother\n______ 47. Which one does Nora take care of?\na. goat\nb. chickens\nc. carabao\nSection 2: Vocabulary\n______ 48. In \"The Story of the First Thanksgiving,\" what does the word harvest mean?\na) a big ship\nb) the food that is gathered from crops\nc) a type of celebration\nd) a difficult time\n______ 49. In \"The Little Seed\'s Journey,\" what does the word nectar mean?\na) a sweet liquid found in flowers',1,1,'answer'),
