(818,202,74,'pre',13,'Pre-test · page 12','open','Listen and look at the page. Type or say your answers with their numbers, for example 1-b, 2-a.','29. What is the purpose of the beginning of a story (exposition)?\na. To solve the problem\nb. To introduce characters and setting\nc. To present the most exciting action\nd. To provide the moral lesson\n30. Which of these is a theme that might be found in a fable?\na. The chemical process of photosynthesis\nb. The importance of honesty\nc. The history of ancient Rome\nd. The rules of a board game\n31. What does the prefix \"re-\" mean in the word \"rewrite\"?\na. Not\nb. Again\nc. Before\nd. After\n32. Which sentence uses correct subject-verb agreement?\na. The four sons argues.\nb. The four sons argue.\nc. The four sons is arguing.\nd. The four sons was arguing.\n33. What is the term for the actual, dictionary definition of a word?\na. Connotation\nb. Denotation\nc. Synonym\nd. Acronym\n34. In the story \"The Farmer and His Four Sons,\" what does the bundle of sticks\nsymbolize?\na. Individual strength\nb. Family quarrels\nc. Unity and strength\nd. Old age and weakness\n35. Which part of a story comes after the climax?\na. Exposition\nb. Rising Action\nc. Falling Action\nd. Introduction\n36. What is the term for a conversation between two or more characters?\na. Monologue\nb. Dialogue\nc. Narration\nd. Description',NULL,'[]','29. What is the purpose of the beginning of a story (exposition)? a. To solve the problem b. To introduce characters and setting c. To present the most exciting action d. To provide the moral lesson 30. Which of these is a theme that might be found in a fable? a. The chemical process of photosynthesis b. The importance of honesty c. The history of ancient Rome d. The rules of a board game 31. What does the prefix \"re-\" mean in the word \"rewrite\"? a. Not b. Again c. Before d. After 32. Which sentence uses correct subject-verb agreement? a. The four sons argues. b. The four sons argue. c. The fo