(844,223,75,'post',3,'Post-test · page 3','open','Listen and look at the page. Type or say your answers with their numbers, for example 1-b, 2-a.','19. Which of these will they do if they are hungry?\na) pick flowers\nb) pick star apples\nc) go swimming\n20. Doing something \"fun\" means ______\n.\na) doing something in the summer\nb) doing something in the house\nc) doing something that we like\n21. Which of these is the best example of being helpful?\na) picking flowers\nb) cleaning up\nc) swimming\n22. What is it that Nina does not like?\na) playing tag\nb) playing house\nc) getting wet in the rain\n23. What does Nina want to do?\na) play tag\nb) play house\nc) get wet in the rain\n24. Who wants to play tag?\na) Ria\nb) Nina\nc) Ria and Nina\n25. What is \"tag?\"\na) a card game\nb) a video game\nc) a running game\n26. Why wasn’t it a good idea to play tag in the house?\na) Something might break.\nb) Someone might get tired.\nc) Something might get lost.\n27. Which word tells what Ria and Nina should be?\na) careless\nb) careful\nc) curious\n28. Who was Curly?\na) a dog\nb) a doll\nc) a cat\n29. Who gave Curly to Miriam?\na) Father\nb) Mother\nc) Uncle Max\n30. Where does Uncle Max live?\na) Cebu',NULL,'[]','19. Which of these will they do if they are hungry? a) pick flowers b) pick star apples c) go swimming 20. Doing something \"fun\" means blank . a) doing something in the summer b) doing something in the house c) doing something that we like 21. Which of these is the best example of being helpful? a) picking flowers b) cleaning up c) swimming 22. What is it that Nina does not like? a) playing tag b) playing house c) getting wet in the rain 23. What does Nina want to do? a) play tag b) play house c) get wet in the rain 24. Who wants to play tag? a) Ria b) Nina c) Ria and Nina 25. What is \"tag?\" a) a card game b) a video game c) a running game 26. Why wasn’t it a good idea to play tag in the house? a) Something might break. b) Someone might get tired. c) Some