(864,230,NULL,'learn',1,'Jumbled Letters · questions','open','Listen and look at the page. Type or say your answers with their numbers, for example 1-b, 2-a.','Jumbled Letters\nActivity 5\nDirections: Arrange the letters below to form a word. Refer\nyour answer on the word definition below. Write your answer in\nthe blank.\n1\npac\n______ 8\nbirck ______\n2\npuc ______\n9\noblw ______\n3\nopt\n______ 10\nfenik ______\n4\nkesd ______\n11\npila ______\n5\n12\nnep ______\ncesa ______\n6\n______ 13\nipe ______\npincle\n7\n______ palet ______ ______\n1. It covers the head\n- cap\n2. A small bowl-shaped container use for drinking - cup\n3. A round container used for cooking food - pot\n4. A flat furniture used for writing, reading and other work - desk\n5. A box or container for pen and pencils - case\n6. A long, thin object made of wood with black end used for writing\n- pencil\n7. A flat dish where food is served or eaten - plate\n8. A small rectangular block made of clay use for building - brick\n9. A round, deep dish or basin used for food or liquid - bowl\n10. A blade fixed into a handle, used for cutting or as a weapon - knife\n11. A bucket used for fetching water - pail\n12. An instrument for writing or drawing with ink - pen\n13. A baked dish of fruit, or meat and vegetables - pie',NULL,'[]','Jumbled Letters Activity 5 Directions: Arrange the letters below to form a word. Refer your answer on the word definition below. Write your answer in the blank. 1 pac blank 8 birck blank 2 puc blank 9 oblw blank 3 opt blank 10 fenik blank 4 kesd blank 11 pila blank 5 12 nep blank cesa blank 6 blank 13 ipe blank pincle 7 blank palet blank blank 1. It covers the head - cap 2. A small bowl-shaped container use for drinking - cup 3. A round container used for cooking food - pot 4. A flat furniture used for writing, reading and other work - desk 5. A box or container for pen and pencils - case 6. A long, thin object made of wood with black end used for writing - pencil 7. A flat dish where food is served or eaten - plate 8. A small rectangular block made of clay use for building - brick 9. A round, deep dish or basin used for food or liquid - bowl 10. A blade fixed into a handle, used for cutting or as a weapon - knife 11. A bucket used for fetching water - pail 12. An instrument for writing or drawing with ink - pen 13. A baked dish of fruit, or meat and vegetables - pie',NULL,10,22,'Jumbled Letters\nActivity 5\nDirections: Arrange the letters below to form a word. Refer\nyour answer on the word definition below. Write your answer in\nthe blank.\n1\npac\n______ 8\nbirck ______\n2\npuc ______\n9\noblw ______\n3\nopt\n______ 10\nfenik ______\n4\nkesd ______\n11\npila ______\n5\n12\nnep ______\ncesa ______\n6\n______ 13\nipe ______\npincle\n7\n______ palet ______ ______\n1. It covers the head\n- cap\n2. A small bowl-shaped container use for drinking - cup\n3. A round container used for cooking food - pot\n4. A flat furniture used for writing, reading and other work - desk\n5. A box or container for pen and pencils - case\n6. A long, thin object made of wood with black end used for writing\n- pencil\n7. A flat dish where food is served or eaten - plate\n8. A small rectangular block made of clay use for building - brick\n9. A round, deep dish or basin used for food or liquid - bowl\n10. A blade fixed into a handle, used for cutting or as a weapon - knife\n11. A bucket used for fetching water - pail\n12. An instrument for writing or drawing with ink - pen\n13. A baked dish of fruit, or meat and vegetables - pie',1,1,'answer'),
