(872,236,78,'post',1,'Post-assessment (Activities 1–10) · questions','open','Listen and look at the page. Type or say your answers with their numbers, for example 1-b, 2-a.','Post-assessment (Activity 1-10)\nA. Vocabulary Development (1–10)\nInstructions: Choose the best word from the word bank to complete each\nsentence. Write the word on the line.\nHuge\nfriend\ngift\ndead\nClean\ndesk\nlearn\nCountry\npie\nabove\n2\n1. We took a vacation to the ______\nand enjoyed the scenery.\n2. I do my homework at my ______\n.\n3. She gave him a ______\nfor his birthday.\n4. The elephant was ______\n, towering over the other animals.\n5. We ate a delicious apple ______\nfor dessert.\n6. A true ______\nis always there for you.\n7. The plant is ______\nand dry.\n8. The airplane flew ______\nthe clouds.\n9. Please keep your room ______\nand tidy.\n10. I want to ______\nhow to play the guitar.',NULL,'[]','Post-assessment (Activity 1-10) A. Vocabulary Development (1–10) Instructions: Choose the best word from the word bank to complete each sentence. Write the word on the line. Huge friend gift dead Clean desk learn Country pie above 2 1. We took a vacation to the blank and enjoyed the scenery. 2. I do my homework at my blank . 3. She gave him a blank for his birthday. 4. The elephant was blank , towering over the other animals. 5. We ate a delicious apple blank for dessert. 6. A true blank is always there for you. 7. The plant is blank and dry. 8. The airplane flew blank the clouds. 9. Please keep your room blank and tidy. 10. I want to blank how to play the guitar.',NULL,10,31,'Post-assessment (Activity 1-10)\nA. Vocabulary Development (1–10)\nInstructions: Choose the best word from the word bank to complete each\nsentence. Write the word on the line.\nHuge\nfriend\ngift\ndead\nClean\ndesk\nlearn\nCountry\npie\nabove\n2\n1. We took a vacation to the ______\nand enjoyed the scenery.\n2. I do my homework at my ______\n.\n3. She gave him a ______\nfor his birthday.\n4. The elephant w