(968,312,84,'pre',1,'Pre-test · Reading','open','Read the stories. Then read the questions carefully and encircle the correct answer.','Read the stories. Then read the questions carefully and encircle the correct answer.\n\nPre-test\nI am Miko. I have a friend. His name is Tito.\nTito is a smart cat. I feed him rice and fish.\nTito and I play together.\n\nDana’s father is a farmer. He goes to farm every day.\nHe works on the farm. He plants rice and corn on the farm.\n\nDolly is a doll. She has long and curly hair.\nIsn’t she pretty? She has a nice dress.\nI bring her to school. I love Dolly so much!\n\nTito is a smart ______.\na. cat\nb. dog\nc. pig\n\nTito eats ______.\na. rice and fish\nb. rice and meat\nc. rice and fruits\n\nDana’s father is a ______?\na. farmer\nb. driver\nc. teacher\n\nWhat did he plant on the farm?\na. Ubi and gabi\nb. Rice and corn\nc. Sugar cane\n\nWho is Dolly?\na. a cat\nb. a doll\nc. a rat','assets/images/level6/g1/p006-1.webp','[\"assets/images/level6/g1/p006-1.webp\"]','Read the stories. Then read the questions carefully and encircle the correct answer.\n\nPre-test\nI am Miko. I have a friend. His name is Tito.\nTito is a smart cat. I feed him rice and fish.\nTito and I play together.\n\nDana’s father is a farmer. He goes to farm every day.\nHe works on the farm. He plants rice and corn on the farm.\n\nDolly is a doll. She has long and curly hair.\nIsn’t she pretty? She has a nice dress.\nI bring her to school. I love Dolly so much!\n\nTito is a smart ______.\na. cat\nb. dog\nc. pig\n\nTito eats ______.\na. rice and fish\nb. rice and meat\nc. rice and fruits\n\nDana’s father is a ______?\na. farmer\nb. driver\nc. teacher\n\nWhat did he plant on the farm?\na. Ubi and gabi\nb. Rice and corn\nc. Sugar cane\n\nWho is Dolly?\na. a cat\nb. a doll\nc. a rat',NULL,10,6,'Read the stories. Then read the questions carefully and encircle the correct answer.\n\nPre-test\nI am Miko. I have a friend. His name is Tito.\nTito is a smart cat. I feed him