(969,312,84,'pre',2,'Pre-test · Reality or Fantasy','open','Direction: Write R for Reality and F for Fantasy on the space provided.','Direction: Write R for Reality and F for Fantasy on the space provided.\n\nA cow can give milk.\nR – Reality\nF – Fantasy\n\nThe baby goats drink milk from their mother goat.\nR – Reality\nF – Fantasy\n\nThe grass eats the mother goat.\nR – Reality\nF – Fantasy\n\nHorse Lino, goat Lucy and cow Lita are animals.\nR – Reality\nF – Fantasy\n\nCows and goats can give milk and meat too.\nR – Reality\nF – Fantasy',NULL,'[]','Direction: Write R for Reality and F for Fantasy on the space provided.\n\nA cow can give milk.\nR – Reality\nF – Fantasy\n\nThe baby goats drink milk from their mother goat.\nR – Reality\nF – Fantasy\n\nThe grass eats the mother goat.\nR – Reality\nF – Fantasy\n\nHorse Lino, goat Lucy and cow Lita are animals.\nR – Reality\nF – Fantasy\n\nCows and goats can give milk and meat too.\nR – Reality\nF – Fantasy',NULL,10,7,'Direction: Write R for Reality and F for Fantasy on the space provided.\n\nA cow can give milk.\nR – Reality\nF – Fantasy\n\nThe baby goats drink milk from their mother goat.\nR – Reality\nF – Fantasy\n\nThe grass eats the mother goat.\nR – Reality\nF – Fantasy\n\nHorse Lino, goat Lucy and cow Lita are animals.\nR – Reality\nF – Fantasy\n\nCows and goats can give milk and meat too.\nR – Reality\nF – Fantasy',1,1,'answer'),
(970,312,84,'pre',3,'Pre-test · Sequencing','open','Direction: Put the sentences in order by arranging the events listed below. Write numbers 1, 2, 3, 4, and 5 on the blank provided.','Direction: Put the sentences in order by arranging the events listed below. Write numbers 1, 2, 3, 4, and 5 on the blank provided.\n\nItems 11–15. Write 1, 2, 3, 4, 5 before each event to show the order.\n11. Bear finds a den.\n12. Bear eats a lot.\n13. Bear eats even more!\n14. Bear fills the den with leaves, so he will stay warm.\n15. Bear needs to get ready for winter.',NULL,'[]','Direction: Put the sentences in order by arranging the events listed below. Write numbers 1, 2, 3, 4, and 5 on the blank provided.\n\nItems 11–15. Write 1, 2, 3, 4, 5 before each event to show the order.\n11. Bear finds a den.\n12. Bear eats a lot.\n13. Bear eats even more!\n14. Bear fills the den with leaves, so he will stay warm.\n15. Bear needs to get ready for winter.',NULL,10,7,'Direction: Put the sentences in order by arranging the events listed below. Write numbers 1, 2, 3, 4, and 5 on the blank provided.\n\nItems 11–15. Write 1, 2, 3, 4, 5 before each event to show the order.\n11. Bear finds a den.\n12. Bear eats a lot.\n13. Bear eats even more!\n14. Bear fills the den with leaves, so he will stay warm.\n15. Bear needs to get ready for winter.',1,1,'answer'),
