(976,317,NULL,'learn',1,'Lita the Cow','open','Direction: Read the story. Write R for Reality and F for Fantasy on the space provided.','Direction: Read the story. Write R for Reality and F for Fantasy on the space provided.\n\nLita the Cow\nLita is a cow.\nShe lived with her family on the farm.\nShe’s a mother to a cute calf.\nHer partner is a strong and big bull.\nLita eats grass.\nShe gives milk.\nShe spends time playing with her friends.\nHorse Lino and goat Lucy were her friends.\n\nA cow can give milk.\nR – Reality\nF – Fantasy\n\nCow Lita is a goat.\nR – Reality\nF – Fantasy\n\nCow Lita is a strong horse.\nR – Reality\nF – Fantasy\n\nHorse Lino, goat Lucy and cow Lita are animals.\nR – Reality\nF – Fantasy\n\nCow Lita eats grass.\nR – Reality\nF – Fantasy','assets/images/level6/g1/p014-1.webp','[\"assets/images/level6/g1/p014-1.webp\"]','Direction: Read the story. Write R for Reality and F for Fantasy on the space provided.\n\nLita the Cow\nLita is a cow.\nShe lived with her family on the farm.\nShe’s a mother to a cute calf.\nHer partner is a strong and big bull.\nLita eats grass.\nShe gives milk.\nShe spends time playing with her friends.\nHorse Lino and goat Lucy were her friends.\n\nA cow can give milk.\nR – Reality\nF – Fantasy\n\nCow Lita is a goat.\nR – Reality\nF – Fantasy\n\nCow Lita is a strong horse.\nR – Reality\nF – Fantasy\n\nHorse Lino, goat Lucy and cow Lita are animals.\nR – Reality\nF – Fantasy\n\nCow Lita eats grass.\nR – Reality\nF – Fantasy',NULL,10,14,'Direction: Read the story. Write R for Reality and F for Fantasy on the space provided.\n\nLita the Cow\nLita is a cow.\nShe lived with her family on the farm.\nShe’s a mother to a cute calf.\nHer partner is a strong and big bull.\nLita eats grass.\nShe gives milk.\nShe spends time playing with her friends.\nHorse Lino and goat Lucy were her friends.\n\nA cow can give milk.\nR – Reality\nF – Fantasy\n\nCow Lita is a goat.\nR – Reality\nF – Fantasy\n\nCow Lita is a strong horse.\nR – Realit