(977,318,NULL,'learn',1,'Rosa’s Goat','open','Direction: Read the selection. Write R for Reality and F for Fantasy on the space provided.','Direction: Read the selection. Write R for Reality and F for Fantasy on the space provided.\n\nRosa’s Goat\nRosa has a goat. It is a mother goat.\nIt has two baby goats.\nMother goat eats grass.\nThe mother goat is black.\nThe babies are black and white.\nThe baby goats drink milk from their mother goat.\nRosa has three goats.\n\nRosa is a goat.\nR – Reality\nF – Fantasy\n\nThe mother goat has five baby goats.\nR – Reality\nF – Fantasy\n\nThe baby goats drink milk from their mother goat.\nR – Reality\nF – Fantasy\n\nThe grass eats the mother goat.\nR – Reality\nF – Fantasy\n\nMother goat has milk.\nR – Reality\nF – Fantasy','assets/images/level6/g1/p015-1.webp','[\"assets/images/level6/g1/p015-1.webp\"]','Direction: Read the selection. Write R for Reality and F for Fantasy on the space provided.\n\nRosa’s Goat\nRosa has a goat. It is a mother goat.\nIt has two baby goats.\nMother goat eats grass.\nThe mother goat is black.\nThe babies are black and white.\nThe baby goats drink milk from their mother goat.\nRosa has three goats.\n\nRosa is a goat.\nR – Reality\nF – Fantasy\n\nThe mother goat has five baby goats.\nR – Reality\nF – Fantasy\n\nThe baby goats drink milk from their mother goat.\nR – Reality\nF – Fantasy\n\nThe grass eats the mother goat.\nR – Reality\nF – Fantasy\n\nMother goat has milk.\nR – Reality\nF – Fantasy',NULL,10,15,'Direction: Read the selection. Write R for Reality and F for Fantasy on the space provided.\n\nRosa’s Goat\nRosa has a goat. It is a mother goat.\nIt has two baby goats.\nMother goat eats grass.\nThe mother goat is black.\nThe babies are black and white.\nThe baby goats drink milk from their mother goat.\nRosa has three goats.\n\nRosa is a goat.\nR – Reality\nF – Fantasy\n\nThe mother goat has five baby goats.\nR – Reality\nF – Fantasy\n\nThe baby goats drink milk from their mother goat.\nR – Rea