(978,319,NULL,'learn',1,'Benny’s Happy Day','open','Direction: Read the selection. Write R for Reality and F for Fantasy on the space provided.','Direction: Read the selection. Write R for Reality and F for Fantasy on the space provided.\n\nBenny’s Happy Day\nBenny the bear loved to play.\nHe played in his backyard.\nHe saw a bright sun shining in the sky.\nBenny picked a colorful flower for his mom.\nHe felt happy and danced with his friends.\nBenny said, “Today is the best day ever”.\n\nBenny was playing in his backyard.\nR – Reality\nF – Fantasy\n\nHe picked a golden crown for his mom.\nR – Reality\nF – Fantasy\n\nHe was playing with animals and fairies.\nR – Reality\nF – Fantasy\n\nPicking flowers for Benny’s mother made him happy.\nR – Reality\nF – Fantasy\n\nFinally, Benny said, “Today is the best day ever”.\nR – Reality\nF – Fantasy','assets/images/level6/g1/p016-1.webp','[\"assets/images/level6/g1/p016-1.webp\"]','Direction: Read the selection. Write R for Reality and F for Fantasy on the space provided.\n\nBenny’s Happy Day\nBenny the bear loved to play.\nHe played in his backyard.\nHe saw a bright sun shining in the sky.\nBenny picked a colorful flower for his mom.\nHe felt happy and danced with his friends.\nBenny said, “Today is the best day ever”.\n\nBenny was playing in his backyard.\nR – Reality\nF – Fantasy\n\nHe picked a golden crown for his mom.\nR – Reality\nF – Fantasy\n\nHe was playing with animals and fairies.\nR – Reality\nF – Fantasy\n\nPicking flowers for Benny’s mother made him happy.\nR – Reality\nF – Fantasy\n\nFinally, Benny said, “Today is the best day ever”.\nR – Reality\nF – Fantasy',NULL,10,16,'Direction: Read the selection. Write R for Reality and F for Fantasy on the space provided.\n\nBenny’s Happy Day\nBenny the bear loved to play.\nHe played in his backyard.\nHe saw a bright sun shining in the sky.\nBenny picked a colorful flower for his mom.\nHe felt happy and danced with his friends.\nBenny said, “Today is the best day ever”.\