(979,320,NULL,'learn',1,'Lily’s Magical Pet','open','Direction: Read the selection. Write R for Reality and F for Fantasy on the space provided.','Direction: Read the selection. Write R for Reality and F for Fantasy on the space provided.\n\nLily’s Magical Pet\nLily had a stuffed rabbit named Fluffy.\nOne day, she wished Fluffy could talk and play with her.\nSuddenly, in her dream, Fluffy spoke and said, “Let’s play hide-and-seek!”\nThey played together in a magical garden.\nBut when Lily woke up, Fluffy was just a stuffed animal again.\n\nLily had a stuffed rabbit.\nR – Reality\nF – Fantasy\n\nShe wished Fluffy to talk and play with her.\nR – Reality\nF – Fantasy\n\nLily and Fluffy played in a magical garden.\nR – Reality\nF – Fantasy\n\nLily dreamed of playing Fluffy in a magical garden.\nR – Reality\nF – Fantasy\n\nFluffy was talking in real life.\nR – Reality\nF – Fantasy','assets/images/level6/g1/p017-1.webp','[\"assets/images/level6/g1/p017-1.webp\"]','Direction: Read the selection. Write R for Reality and F for Fantasy on the space provided.\n\nLily’s Magical Pet\nLily had a stuffed rabbit named Fluffy.\nOne day, she wished Fluffy could talk and play with her.\nSuddenly, in her dream, Fluffy spoke and said, “Let’s play hide-and-seek!”\nThey played together in a magical garden.\nBut when Lily woke up, Fluffy was just a stuffed animal again.\n\nLily had a stuffed rabbit.\nR – Reality\nF – Fantasy\n\nShe wished Fluffy to talk and play with her.\nR – Reality\nF – Fantasy\n\nLily and Fluffy played in a magical garden.\nR – Reality\nF – Fantasy\n\nLily dreamed of playing Fluffy in a magical garden.\nR – Reality\nF – Fantasy\n\nFluffy was talking in real life.\nR – Reality\nF – Fantasy',NULL,10,17,'Direction: Read the selection. Write R for Reality and F for Fantasy on the space provided.\n\nLily’s Magical Pet\nLily had a stuffed rabbit named Fluffy.\nOne day, she wished Fluffy could talk and play with her.\nSuddenly, in her dream, Fluffy spoke and said, “Let’s play