(980,321,NULL,'learn',1,'A Cold Bear','open','Direction: Write the numbers 1, 2, 3, 4, 5 before each event as they happen in the story.','Direction: Write the numbers 1, 2, 3, 4, 5 before each event as they happen in the story.\n\nA Cold Bear\nBrrrr! It is getting cold.\nBear needs to get ready for winter.\nFirst, he eats a lot.\nNext, he finds a den.\nThen, he fills the den with leaves, so he will stay warm.\nLast, he eats even more.\nIs Bear ready for winter?\nYes, he is. Winter is here!\n\nWrite 1, 2, 3, 4, 5 before each event as they happen in the story.\nBear finds a den.\nBear eats a lot.\nBear eats even more!\nBear fills the den with leaves, so he will stay warm.\nBear needs to get ready for winter.','assets/images/level6/g1/p018-1.webp','[\"assets/images/level6/g1/p018-1.webp\"]','Direction: Write the numbers 1, 2, 3, 4, 5 before each event as they happen in the story.\n\nA Cold Bear\nBrrrr! It is getting cold.\nBear needs to get ready for winter.\nFirst, he eats a lot.\nNext, he finds a den.\nThen, he fills the den with leaves, so he will stay warm.\nLast, he eats even more.\nIs Bear ready for winter?\nYes, he is. Winter is here!\n\nWrite 1, 2, 3, 4, 5 before each event as they happen in the story.\nBear finds a den.\nBear eats a lot.\nBear eats even more!\nBear fills the den with leaves, so he will stay warm.\nBear needs to get ready for winter.',NULL,10,18,'Direction: Write the numbers 1, 2, 3, 4, 5 before each event as they happen in the story.\n\nA Cold Bear\nBrrrr! It is getting cold.\nBear needs to get ready for winter.\nFirst, he eats a lot.\nNext, he finds a den.\nThen, he fills the den with leaves, so he will stay warm.\nLast, he eats even more.\nIs Bear ready for winter?\nYes, he is. Winter is here!\n\nWrite 1, 2, 3, 4, 5 before each event as they happen in the story.\nBear finds a den.\nBear eats a lot.\nBear eats even more!\nBear fills the den with leaves, so he will stay warm.\nBear needs to get ready for winter.',1,1,'answer'),
