(984,325,NULL,'learn',1,'Happenings','open','Direction: Read the story. Draw a line to match each cause on the left with its effect on the right.','Direction: Read the story. Draw a line to match each cause on the left with its effect on the right.\n\nHappenings\nEmmy got a wound because she fell off her bike.\nTo ease the pain, she eats ice cream.\nHer brother Matt did not study so he failed the Math test.\nJean, her younger sister was unhappy because the wind blew her balloons away.\nShe also went inside the house because she was tired.\n\nColumn A\n1. Matt did not study.\n2. To ease the pain.\n3. Jean went inside her house.\n4. Jean was unhappy.\n5. She fell off her bike.\nA. so Emmy got a wound.\nB. because the wind blows her balloon.\nC. Emmy eats ice cream.\nD. there he failed the Math test.\nE. because she is tired.','assets/images/level6/g1/p022-1.webp','[\"assets/images/level6/g1/p022-1.webp\"]','Direction: Read the story. Draw a line to match each cause on the left with its effect on the right.\n\nHappenings\nEmmy got a wound because she fell off her bike.\nTo ease the pain, she eats ice cream.\nHer brother Matt did not study so he failed the Math test.\nJean, her younger sister was unhappy because the wind blew her balloons away.\nShe also went inside the house because she was tired.\n\nColumn A\n1. Matt did not study.\n2. To ease the pain.\n3. Jean went inside her house.\n4. Jean was unhappy.\n5. She fell off her bike.\nA. so Emmy got a wound.\nB. because the wind blows her balloon.\nC. Emmy eats ice cream.\nD. there he failed the Math test.\nE. because she is tired.',NULL,10,22,'Direction: Read the story. Draw a line to match each cause on the left with its effect on the right.\n\nHappenings\nEmmy got a wound because she fell off her bike.\nTo ease the pain, she eats ice cream.\nHer brother Matt did not study so he failed the Math test.\nJean, her younger sister was unhappy because the wind blew her balloons away.\nShe also went inside the house because