(985,326,NULL,'learn',1,'Activities','open','Direction: Read the story. Draw a line to match each cause on the left with its effect on the right.','Direction: Read the story. Draw a line to match each cause on the left with its effect on the right.\n\nActivities\nIt rained all night, so the classes were cancelled.\nThe children are played all day long.\nLuis went biking with his friends and fell off his bike, so his knee got wounded.\nMary ran fast to Luis, so she slipped.\nHector got scared so he went home.\nBut Letty studied for the next test, so she got an A grade.\n\nColumn A\n1. Hector got scared\n2. Letty studied for the next test.\n3. Luis fell off his bike\n4. It rained all night\n5. Mary ran fast to Luis\nA. so she slipped.\nB. so his knee got wounded.\nC. so the classes are cancelled.\nD. so she got an A grade.\nE. so he went home.','assets/images/level6/g1/p023-1.webp','[\"assets/images/level6/g1/p023-1.webp\"]','Direction: Read the story. Draw a line to match each cause on the left with its effect on the right.\n\nActivities\nIt rained all night, so the classes were cancelled.\nThe children are played all day long.\nLuis went biking with his friends and fell off his bike, so his knee got wounded.\nMary ran fast to Luis, so she slipped.\nHector got scared so he went home.\nBut Letty studied for the next test, so she got an A grade.\n\nColumn A\n1. Hector got scared\n2. Letty studied for the next test.\n3. Luis fell off his bike\n4. It rained all night\n5. Mary ran fast to Luis\nA. so she slipped.\nB. so his knee got wounded.\nC. so the classes are cancelled.\nD. so she got an A grade.\nE. so he went home.',NULL,10,23,'Direction: Read the story. Draw a line to match each cause on the left with its effect on the right.\n\nActivities\nIt rained all night, so the classes were cancelled.\nThe children are played all day long.\nLuis went biking with his friends and fell off his bike, so his knee got wounded.\nMary ran fast to Luis, so she slipped.\nHector got s