(986,327,NULL,'learn',1,'Good Ways','open','Direction: Read the story. Draw a line to match each cause on the left with its effect on the right.','Direction: Read the story. Draw a line to match each cause on the left with its effect on the right.\n\nGood Ways\nOne Sunday, Lino went to the garden to check the vegetables he planted.\nWhile walking fast, a branch hit his forehead.\nHe picked malunggay leaves, crushed them, and rubbed them on his forehead.\nHe continued gathering vegetables to bring them home.\nHe cooked them to have a delicious viand.\n\nColumn A\n1. Lino went to the garden.\n2. He picked malunggay leaves\n3. Lino cooked the vegetables\n4. He was walking fast\n5. To be able to bring home some vegetables\nA. so they had a delicious viand.\nB. when a branch hit his head.\nC. and rubbed it on his forehead\nD. he gathered it.\nE. to check the vegetables.','assets/images/level6/g1/p024-1.webp','[\"assets/images/level6/g1/p024-1.webp\"]','Direction: Read the story. Draw a line to match each cause on the left with its effect on the right.\n\nGood Ways\nOne Sunday, Lino went to the garden to check the vegetables he planted.\nWhile walking fast, a branch hit his forehead.\nHe picked malunggay leaves, crushed them, and rubbed them on his forehead.\nHe continued gathering vegetables to bring them home.\nHe cooked them to have a delicious viand.\n\nColumn A\n1. Lino went to the garden.\n2. He picked malunggay leaves\n3. Lino cooked the vegetables\n4. He was walking fast\n5. To be able to bring home some vegetables\nA. so they had a delicious viand.\nB. when a branch hit his head.\nC. and rubbed it on his forehead\nD. he gathered it.\nE. to check the vegetables.',NULL,10,24,'Direction: Read the story. Draw a line to match each cause on the left with its effect on the right.\n\nGood Ways\nOne Sunday, Lino went to the garden to check the vegetables he planted.\nWhile walking fast, a branch hit his forehead.\nHe picked malunggay leaves, crushed them, and rubbed them 