ith his new dog.\n\nRex got a new dog.\nR – Reality\nF – Fantasy\n\nHis dog could fly over the clouds.\nR – Reality\nF – Fantasy\n\nRex takes his dog to the park.\nR – Reality\nF – Fantasy\n\nRex and his dog barked each other.\nR – Reality\nF – Fantasy\n\nThe dog went shopping at the mall.\nR – Reality\nF – Fantasy',1,1,'answer'),
(1008,342,NULL,'learn',1,'My New Pet','open','Activity 2.4 · Fantasy or Reality tells if the events in the story are real or not. Direction: In the space provided, put a (✓) in the box if it is reality and (X) for fantasy.','Activity 2.4 · Fantasy or Reality tells if the events in the story are real or not. Direction: In the space provided, put a (✓) in the box if it is reality and (X) for fantasy.\n\nMy New Pet\nMy dad bought me a new pet.\nShe is a cute little kitten.\nShe is always sleepy.\nMy dad and mom help me keep the kitten clean.\nWe have a box house where she stays.\nI always play with her in the evening when I come home from school.\nShe is growing quickly. I love my new pet.\n\nHer dad bought her a new pet cat.\n✓ Reality\nX Fantasy\n\nHer pet clean the house with her parents.\n✓ Reality\nX Fantasy\n\nThe cat keeps on barking loudly.\n✓ Reality\nX Fantasy\n\nShe loves her cat’s long horn.\n✓ Reality\nX Fantasy\n\nShe plays with her cat in the evening.\n✓ Reality\nX Fantasy','assets/images/level6/g2/p020-1.webp','[\"assets/images/level6/g2/p020-1.webp\"]','Activity 2.4 · Fantasy or Reality tells if the events in the story are real or not. Direction: In the space provided, put a (✓) in the box if it is reality and (X) for fantasy.\n\nMy New Pet\nMy dad bought me a new pet.\nShe is a cute little kitten.\nShe is always sleepy.\nMy dad and mom help me keep the kitten clean.\nWe have a box house where she stays.\nI always play with her in the evening when I come home from school.\nShe is growing quickly. I love my new pet.\n\nHer dad bought her a new pet cat.\n✓ Reality\nX Fantasy\n\nHer pet clean the house with her parents.\n✓ Reality\nX Fantasy\n\nThe cat keeps on barking loudly.\n✓ Reality\nX Fantasy\n\nShe loves her cat’s long horn.\n✓ Reality\nX Fantasy\n\nShe plays with her cat in the evening.\n✓ Reality\nX Fantasy',NULL,10,20,'Activity 2.4 · Fantasy or Reality tells if the events in the story are real or not. Direction: In the space provided, put a (✓) 