(1031,358,NULL,'learn',1,'A Gift from Uncle','open','Direction: Read the story below and encircle the letter of the correct answer.','Direction: Read the story below and encircle the letter of the correct answer.\n\nA Gift from Uncle\nDo you have an uncle living far away? Miriam has. His name is Max. Miriam calls him Uncle Max. He lives in New York.\n\nLast Christmas, Uncle Max sent Miriam a gift. It came in a big box. Father helped her open the box.\n\nThen they saw something very pretty. It had round blue eyes. It had a small red mouth. It had a blue lace dress and curly black hair. Miriam called her Curly. She loved to play with it. What Miriam liked best was the way Curly walked. Miriam would hold one of its hands and they would walk together around the sala. Curly made Miriam happy.\n\nWho is Curly?\nA. a dog\nB. a doll\nC. a cat\n\nWho gave curly to Miriam?\nA. Father\nB. Mother\nC. Uncle Max\n\nWhere does Uncle Max live?\nA. Manila\nB. New York\nC. Cebu\n\nOn what occasion was Curly given?\nA. Christmas\nB. Birthday\nC. Graduation\n\nWho helped Miriam open the box?\nA. Mother\nB. Father\nC. Uncle Max\n\nWhy did Uncle Max send Miriam a gift?\nA. It was Christmas\nB. It was her birthday\nC. It was New Year\n\nWhat would you do if someone will gave you a gift?\nA. say thank you\nB. just smile\nC. do nothing\n\nWhat do you think Miriam felt about the gift she received?\nA. happy\nB. sad\nC. angry','assets/images/level6/g3/p017-1.webp','[\"assets/images/level6/g3/p017-1.webp\"]','Direction: Read the story below and encircle the letter of the correct answer.\n\nA Gift from Uncle\nDo you have an uncle living far away? Miriam has. His name is Max. Miriam calls him Uncle Max. He lives in New York.\n\nLast Christmas, Uncle Max sent Miriam a gift. It came in a big box. Father helped her open the box.\n\nThen they saw something very pretty. It had round blue eyes. It had a small red mouth. It had a blue lace dress and curly black hair. Miriam called her Curly. She loved 