(1036,362,NULL,'learn',2,'Getting the General Significance','open','Direction: Read the selections below and choose the letter of the correct answer.','Direction: Read the selections below and choose the letter of the correct answer.\n\nNida combed her hair and tied it with a ribbon. She changed her sleeping clothes with working clothes. She got a bolo and went to the garden.\n\n“Are you going to help me today?” Father asked.\n\n“Yes, Father. It’s Saturday and I have nothing to do. Lilia is helping Mother. I would like to help you, too.”\n\nWhat time of the day was it?\nA. night\nB. afternoon\nC. morning\n\nWhich is the best title for the story?\nA. Saturday morning\nB. Helping at home\nC. How to Comb\n\nWhy were Nida and Lilia at home?\nA. It was Saturday\nB. They were sick\nC. To play all day','assets/images/level6/g3/p026-1.webp','[\"assets/images/level6/g3/p026-1.webp\"]','Direction: Read the selections below and choose the letter of the correct answer.\n\nNida combed her hair and tied it with a ribbon. She changed her sleeping clothes with working clothes. She got a bolo and went to the garden.\n\n“Are you going to help me today?” Father asked.\n\n“Yes, Father. It’s Saturday and I have nothing to do. Lilia is helping Mother. I would like to help you, too.”\n\nWhat time of the day was it?\nA. night\nB. afternoon\nC. morning\n\nWhich is the best title for the story?\nA. Saturday morning\nB. Helping at home\nC. How to Comb\n\nWhy were Nida and Lilia at home?\nA. It was Saturday\nB. They were sick\nC. To play all day',NULL,10,26,'Direction: Read the selections below and choose the letter of the correct answer.\n\nNida combed her hair and tied it with a ribbon. She changed her sleeping clothes with working clothes. She got a bolo and went to the garden.\n\n“Are you going to help me today?” Father asked.\n\n“Yes, Father. It’s Saturday and I have nothing to do. Lilia is helping Mother. I would like to help you, too.”\n\nWhat time of the day was it?\nA. night\nB. after