(1040,364,NULL,'learn',2,'Getting the General Significance','open','Direction: Read the selections below and choose the letter of the correct answer.','Direction: Read the selections below and choose the letter of the correct answer.\n\nMarina got out of her bed in the middle of the night. She went near mother and said, “Mother, please get up. Let’s go to the toilet.\n\nMother, got up and saw Marina holding her stomach. “I told you not to eat much ice cream yesterday. Did you eat santol and guavas, too?\n\nI did, Mother,” Marina replied.\n\nWhat did Marina do the day before?\nA. ate cake and candies\nB. ate fruits and ice cream\nC. ate peanuts and chicos\n\nWhat does the story tell about Marina?\nA. She got up to study.\nB. She got up to eat santol\nC. She got up to go to the toilet.\n\nWhy was Marina holding her stomach?\nA. It was painful.\nB. She was hungry.\nC. It was full','assets/images/level6/g3/p030-1.webp','[\"assets/images/level6/g3/p030-1.webp\"]','Direction: Read the selections below and choose the letter of the correct answer.\n\nMarina got out of her bed in the middle of the night. She went near mother and said, “Mother, please get up. Let’s go to the toilet.\n\nMother, got up and saw Marina holding her stomach. “I told you not to eat much ice cream yesterday. Did you eat santol and guavas, too?\n\nI did, Mother,” Marina replied.\n\nWhat did Marina do the day before?\nA. ate cake and candies\nB. ate fruits and ice cream\nC. ate peanuts and chicos\n\nWhat does the story tell about Marina?\nA. She got up to study.\nB. She got up to eat santol\nC. She got up to go to the toilet.\n\nWhy was Marina holding her stomach?\nA. It was painful.\nB. She was hungry.\nC. It was full',NULL,10,30,'Direction: Read the selections below and choose the letter of the correct answer.\n\nMarina got out of her bed in the middle of the night. She went near mother and said, “Mother, please get up. Let’s go to the toilet.\n\nMother, got up and saw Marina holding her stomach. “I 