(1044,366,NULL,'learn',2,'Getting the General Significance','open','Direction: Read the selections below and choose the letter of the correct answer.','Direction: Read the selections below and choose the letter of the correct answer.\n\nAling Ines was very happy watching her children. Rosita was cleaning the house. Anita was taking care of her baby sister. Lino was watering the plants in the garden. Petra went to the market.\n\n“I told the doctor that you have fever, Mother. He will be here soon,” Petra said when she came from the market.\n\n“Thank you, Petra. You’re a good girl,” Mother said.\n\nWhy was Aling Ines not working?\nA. She was lazy.\nB. She had a visitor.\nC. She was sick.\n\nWhat was the story about?\nA. helpful children\nB. how to clean the house\nC. how to go to market\n\nWhat lesson does the story teach?\nA. Love your neighbor\nB. Love you pets\nC. Love your family','assets/images/level6/g3/p034-1.webp','[\"assets/images/level6/g3/p034-1.webp\"]','Direction: Read the selections below and choose the letter of the correct answer.\n\nAling Ines was very happy watching her children. Rosita was cleaning the house. Anita was taking care of her baby sister. Lino was watering the plants in the garden. Petra went to the market.\n\n“I told the doctor that you have fever, Mother. He will be here soon,” Petra said when she came from the market.\n\n“Thank you, Petra. You’re a good girl,” Mother said.\n\nWhy was Aling Ines not working?\nA. She was lazy.\nB. She had a visitor.\nC. She was sick.\n\nWhat was the story about?\nA. helpful children\nB. how to clean the house\nC. how to go to market\n\nWhat lesson does the story teach?\nA. Love your neighbor\nB. Love you pets\nC. Love your family',NULL,10,34,'Direction: Read the selections below and choose the letter of the correct answer.\n\nAling Ines was very happy watching her children. Rosita was cleaning the house. Anita was taking care of her baby sister. Lino was watering the plants in the garden. Petra went to 