(1045,367,NULL,'learn',1,'Hearing Mass','open','Direction: Read the selections below and choose the letter of the correct answer.','Direction: Read the selections below and choose the letter of the correct answer.\n\nHearing Mass\nOne Sunday morning, Father, Mother, Teresita and Marivic were attending mass. They could not wait any longer for the mass to end. During consecration, Marivic began to cry loudly. Everybody turned to look at her.\n\nHow did Mother feel when Marivic started to cry in the church?\nA. excited\nB. angry\nC. embarrassed\n\nIf you were Mother and Father, what would you do?\nA. Spank Marivic\nB. Take Marivic out of the church\nC. Scold Marivic and finish the mass\n\nWhat should Father and Mother do with Marivic next time they go to mass?\nA. Remind Marivic to behave well at church\nB. Let her play in the church patio\nC. Bring her along and not mind if she annoys the other people in the church','assets/images/level6/g3/p035-1.webp','[\"assets/images/level6/g3/p035-1.webp\"]','Direction: Read the selections below and choose the letter of the correct answer.\n\nHearing Mass\nOne Sunday morning, Father, Mother, Teresita and Marivic were attending mass. They could not wait any longer for the mass to end. During consecration, Marivic began to cry loudly. Everybody turned to look at her.\n\nHow did Mother feel when Marivic started to cry in the church?\nA. excited\nB. angry\nC. embarrassed\n\nIf you were Mother and Father, what would you do?\nA. Spank Marivic\nB. Take Marivic out of the church\nC. Scold Marivic and finish the mass\n\nWhat should Father and Mother do with Marivic next time they go to mass?\nA. Remind Marivic to behave well at church\nB. Let her play in the church patio\nC. Bring her along and not mind if she annoys the other people in the church',NULL,10,35,'Direction: Read the selections below and choose the letter of the correct answer.\n\nHearing Mass\nOne Sunday morning, Father, Mother, Teresita and Marivic were attending mass. They could not wait any longer for the mass to end. During consecration, Marivic began to cry loudly. Everybody turned to look at her.\n\nHow did Mother feel when Marivic started to cry in the church?\nA. excited\nB. angry\nC. embarrassed\n\nIf you were Mother and Father, what would you do?\nA. Spank Marivic\nB. Take Marivic out of the church\nC. Scold Marivic and finish the mass\n\nWhat should Father and Mother do with Marivic next time they go to mass?\nA. Remind Marivic to behave well at church\nB. Let her play in the church patio\nC. Bring her along and not mind if she annoys the other people in the church',1,1,'answer'),
(1046,367,NULL,'learn',2,'The Big, Pink Bundle of Joy','open','Direction: Read the selections below and choose the letter of the correct answer.','Direction: Read the selections below and choose the letter of the correct answer.\n\nThe Big, Pink Bundle of Joy\nMother had been in the hospital for five days. She could hardly wait to bring the big, pink bundle of joy to the children. Mother held the pink bundle lovingly to her bosom while Father called for a taxi.\n\nWhere were Father and Mother?\nA. in the hospital\nB. in the supermarket\nC. in the store\n\nWhy were they there?\nA. Mother was sick\nB. Mother delivered a baby\nC. Mother met an accident\n\nWhere were they going?\nA. home\nB. to the hospital\nC. to the park','assets/images/level6/g3/p036-1.webp','[\"assets/images/level6/g3/p036-1.webp\"]','Direction: Read the selections below and choose the letter of the correct answer.\n\nThe Big, Pink Bundle of Joy\nMother had been in the hospital for five days. She could hardly wait to bring the big, pink bundle of joy to the children. Mother held the pink bundle lovingly to her bosom while Father called for a taxi.\n\nWhere were Father and Mother?\nA. in the hospital\nB. in the supermarket\nC. in the store\n\nWhy were they there?\nA. Mother was sick\nB. Mother delivered a baby\nC. Mother met an accident\n\nWhere were they going?\nA. home\nB. to the hospital\nC. to the park',NULL,10,36,'Direction: Read the selections below and choose the letter of the correct answer.\n\nThe Big, Pink Bundle of Joy\nMother had been in the hospital for five days. She could hardly wait to bring the big, pink bundle of joy to the children. Mother held the pink bundle lovingly to her bosom while Father called for a taxi.\n\nWhere were Father and Mother?\nA. in the hospital\nB. in the supermarket\nC. in the store\n\nWhy were they there?\nA. Mother was sick\nB. Mother delivered a baby\nC. Mother met an accident\n\nWhere were they going?\nA. home\nB. to the hospital\nC. to the park',1,1,'answ