(1048,368,NULL,'learn',2,'The Ferris Wheel Ride','open','Direction: Read the selections below and choose the letter of the correct answer.','Direction: Read the selections below and choose the letter of the correct answer.\n\nThe Ferris Wheel Ride\nMyrna was scared to ride on the Ferris wheel. One fiesta day, her cousin asked her to ride on the Ferris wheel. When the Ferris wheel turned around, Myrna felt dizzy. She couldn’t look down. She felt as if she was falling.\n\nWhat do you think Myrna wished for?\nA. She wished the ferris wheel would soon stop turning.\nB. She wished that the ferris wheel would never stop turning.\nC. She wished that she had not ridden on a ferris wheel.\n\nDid Myrna enjoy her ride on the ferris wheel?\nA. Yes\nB. No\nC. Maybe\n\nWhat would Myrna do next time?\nA. She would ride on a ferris wheel again.\nB. She would not go to the carnival again.\nC. She would never ride on a ferris wheel again.','assets/images/level6/g3/p038-1.webp','[\"assets/images/level6/g3/p038-1.webp\"]','Direction: Read the selections below and choose the letter of the correct answer.\n\nThe Ferris Wheel Ride\nMyrna was scared to ride on the Ferris wheel. One fiesta day, her cousin asked her to ride on the Ferris wheel. When the Ferris wheel turned around, Myrna felt dizzy. She couldn’t look down. She felt as if she was falling.\n\nWhat do you think Myrna wished for?\nA. She wished the ferris wheel would soon stop turning.\nB. She wished that the ferris wheel would never stop turning.\nC. She wished that she had not ridden on a ferris wheel.\n\nDid Myrna enjoy her ride on the ferris wheel?\nA. Yes\nB. No\nC. Maybe\n\nWhat would Myrna do next time?\nA. She would ride on a ferris wheel again.\nB. She would not go to the carnival again.\nC. She would never ride on a ferris wheel again.',NULL,10,38,'Direction: Read the selections below and choose the letter of the correct answer.\n\nThe Ferris Wheel Ride\nMyrna was scared to ride on the Ferris wheel. One fiesta day, her 