(1049,369,NULL,'learn',1,'Anti-Decay Vaccine','open','Direction: Read the selections below and choose the letter of the correct answer.','Direction: Read the selections below and choose the letter of the correct answer.\n\nAnti-Decay Vaccine\nMost people have had dental problems which start with simple toothache. No matter how well one brushes his teeth, sooner or later cavities are formed which later cause tooth decay.\n\nToday, scientists are busy experimenting to discover a vaccine that would make people immune to tooth decay.\n\nWhy do you think do scientists want to develop the vaccine?\nA. to help children and youth\nB. to help babies\nC. to help people, young and old alike\n\nWhat is the vaccine for?\nA. to prevent bad breath\nB. to prevent deformed teeth\nC. to prevent tooth decay\n\nWhat will be the effect of the vaccine?\nA. Many people will no longer need dentists\nB. People will not brush their teeth anymore\nC. Many people will be saved from pain of having tooth decay','assets/images/level6/g3/p039-1.webp','[\"assets/images/level6/g3/p039-1.webp\"]','Direction: Read the selections below and choose the letter of the correct answer.\n\nAnti-Decay Vaccine\nMost people have had dental problems which start with simple toothache. No matter how well one brushes his teeth, sooner or later cavities are formed which later cause tooth decay.\n\nToday, scientists are busy experimenting to discover a vaccine that would make people immune to tooth decay.\n\nWhy do you think do scientists want to develop the vaccine?\nA. to help children and youth\nB. to help babies\nC. to help people, young and old alike\n\nWhat is the vaccine for?\nA. to prevent bad breath\nB. to prevent deformed teeth\nC. to prevent tooth decay\n\nWhat will be the effect of the vaccine?\nA. Many people will no longer need dentists\nB. People will not brush their teeth anymore\nC. Many people will be saved from pain of having tooth decay',NULL,10,39,'Direction: Read the selections below and choose t