(1050,369,NULL,'learn',2,'Scared Stiff','open','Direction: Read the selections below and choose the letter of the correct answer.','Direction: Read the selections below and choose the letter of the correct answer.\n\nScared Stiff\nMario watched a horror movie that afternoon. That night when he turned off the light to sleep, he suddenly remembered the ghost in the movie. The ghost seemed to be in every corner of his room. It seemed to be peeping at him from the ceiling from the wall, from the door lock, or from the broken windowpane.\n\nSuddenly, he heard something go clink-clank! Then there was a loud “CRUSH” sound from the kitchen.\n\nWhat could it be?\nA. A real ghost\nB. A robber\nC. A glass shaved by the cat\n\nHow did Mario feel?\nA. thrilled\nB. surprised\nC. scared\n\nWhat was Mario likely to do?\nA. watch another horror movie\nB. read a book\nC. sleep with his brother','assets/images/level6/g3/p040-1.webp','[\"assets/images/level6/g3/p040-1.webp\"]','Direction: Read the selections below and choose the letter of the correct answer.\n\nScared Stiff\nMario watched a horror movie that afternoon. That night when he turned off the light to sleep, he suddenly remembered the ghost in the movie. The ghost seemed to be in every corner of his room. It seemed to be peeping at him from the ceiling from the wall, from the door lock, or from the broken windowpane.\n\nSuddenly, he heard something go clink-clank! Then there was a loud “CRUSH” sound from the kitchen.\n\nWhat could it be?\nA. A real ghost\nB. A robber\nC. A glass shaved by the cat\n\nHow did Mario feel?\nA. thrilled\nB. surprised\nC. scared\n\nWhat was Mario likely to do?\nA. watch another horror movie\nB. read a book\nC. sleep with his brother',NULL,10,40,'Direction: Read the selections below and choose the letter of the correct answer.\n\nScared Stiff\nMario watched a horror movie that afternoon. That night when he turned off the light to sleep, he suddenly remembered the ghost in the movie. The ghost seemed