(1081,386,NULL,'learn',1,'Flag','open','Instructions: Read the given story carefully and silently. After reading, answer the questions based on what you understood. Write only the letter of the correct answer on your answer sheet. Make sure to read each question before answering.','Instructions: Read the given story carefully and silently. After reading, answer the questions based on what you understood. Write only the letter of the correct answer on your answer sheet. Make sure to read each question before answering.\n\nFlag\nI. Way up there,\nWaving so high!\nRed and blue, side by side\nWith a triangle of white.\n\nII. Way up there,\nWaving so high!\nThe sun, a golden bright\nOn a triangle of white.\n\nIII. Way up there,\nWaving so high,\nKeep it up right\nFor it we should fight.\n\nThe best little for the poem is______.\nA. our flag\nB. Let’s fight\nC. Up in the sky\n\nThe flag described is a___________.\nA. Philippine flag\nB. American flag\nC. Japanese flag\n\nThe poem teaches us_________.\nA. To look at the flag.\nB. To fight for our flag.\nC. How to draw a flag.\n\nWhat are the colors of flag side by side on it?\nA. black and red\nB. pink and blue\nC. red and blue\n\nWhat is the shape of color white in the flag\nA. circle\nB. triangle\nC. square','assets/images/level6/g4/p029-1.webp','[\"assets/images/level6/g4/p029-1.webp\"]','Instructions: Read the given story carefully and silently. After reading, answer the questions based on what you understood. Write only the letter of the correct answer on your answer sheet. Make sure to read each question before answering.\n\nFlag\nI. Way up there,\nWaving so high!\nRed and blue, side by side\nWith a triangle of white.\n\nII. Way up there,\nWaving so high!\nThe sun, a golden bright\nOn a triangle of white.\n\nIII. Way up there,\nWaving so high,\nKeep it up right\nFor it we should fight.\n\nThe best little for the poem is______.\nA. our flag\nB. Let’s fight\nC. Up in the sky\n\nThe flag described is a___________.\nA. P