(1082,387,NULL,'learn',1,'A Joke','open','Instructions: Read the given story carefully and silently. After reading, answer the questions based on what you understood. Write only the letter of the correct answer on your answer sheet. Make sure to read each question before answering.','Instructions: Read the given story carefully and silently. After reading, answer the questions based on what you understood. Write only the letter of the correct answer on your answer sheet. Make sure to read each question before answering.\n\nA Joke\nCarlito enjoys playing jokes on his brothers, sisters and friends. One day he saw a black rubber mouse for sale in a store. An idea came into his mind so he bought the rubber mouse at once.\n\nWhen he went home, he placed the rubber mouse on one of the steps of their stairs. Pretty soon his sister came down the stairs carrying a big bundle of dirty clothes. When she was on the step where the rubber mouse was, Carlito shouted, “Look! A mouse!”\n\nWhat must have happened to his sister?\nA. She got sick.\nB. She was frightened.\nC. She laughed and laughed.\n\nWhat happened with the bundle of dirty clothes?\nA. It was scattered all around.\nB. It became lighter.\nC. It fell on Carlito’s arms.\n\nWhat do you think did Mother say later?\nA. How we enjoyed your joke!\nB. Play the same joke again to others.\nC. Do not play such a kind of joke anymore.\n\nWhy is that Carlito shouted?\nA. Because he wants to scare her sister.\nB. Because He was surprised seeing the mouse.\nC. Because He was angry seeing the mouse.','assets/images/level6/g4/p030-1.webp','[\"assets/images/level6/g4/p030-1.webp\", \"assets/images/level6/g4/p030-2.webp\"]','Instructions: Read the given story carefully and silently. After reading, answer the questions based on what you understood. Write only the letter of the correct answer on your answer sheet. Make sure to read each question before answering.\n\nA Joke\nCarlito enjoys playing jokes on his brothers, sisters and friends.