(1204,484,NULL,'learn',1,'Trees','open','Read the story carefully, then answer the questions.','Read the story carefully, then answer the questions.\n\nTrees\nTrees are our friends. They give us food. Some trees that give us food are santol, guava, Chico, mango, coconut and many more.\n\nTrees near homes are helpful. They give us shade. They make houses cool and beautiful.\n\nTrees also give materials for clothing. Some trees also give medicine. It is good to plant trees.\n\nCopy the name of the story.\n\nCopy the names of trees that give food.\n\nWhich is true about trees?\nA. Trees make cloth.\nB. Trees are our friends.\nC. Trees make medicine for us.\n\nWhich of the following tells what we should do?\nA. Burn trees\nB. Plant trees\nC. Cut down trees\n\nCopy the sentence that tells what trees do to houses.',NULL,'[]','Read the story carefully, then answer the questions.\n\nTrees\nTrees are our friends. They give us food. Some trees that give us food are santol, guava, Chico, mango, coconut and many more.\n\nTrees near homes are helpful. They give us shade. They make houses cool and beautiful.\n\nTrees also give materials for clothing. Some trees also give medicine. It is good to plant trees.\n\nCopy the name of the story.\n\nCopy the names of trees that give food.\n\nWhich is true about trees?\nA. Trees make cloth.\nB. Trees are our friends.\nC. Trees make medicine for us.\n\nWhich of the following tells what we should do?\nA. Burn trees\nB. Plant trees\nC. Cut down trees\n\nCopy the sentence that tells what trees do to houses.',NULL,10,45,'Read the story carefully, then answer the questions.\n\nTrees\nTrees are our friends. They give us food. Some trees that give us food are santol, guava, Chico, mango, coconut and many more.\n\nTrees near homes are helpful. They give us shade. They make houses cool and beautiful.\n\nTrees also give materials for clothing. Some trees also give medicine. It is good to plant trees.\n\nCopy the name of the story.\n\nCopy the names o