(1210,490,NULL,'learn',1,'Jeepneys','open','Read the story carefully, then answer the questions.','Read the story carefully, then answer the questions.\n\nJeepneys\nJeepneys are fast rides. There are many of them in the century. Jeepneys come in different colors. There are blue, yellow, green and red jeepneys. There are also multicolored ones.\n\nSome jeepneys have stereo sets. There are those with brightly colored curtains. Students who go to school like to ride in curtained jeepneys with stereos.\n\nCopy the sentence that tells what kind of rides jeepneys are.\n\nCopy the different colors of jeepneys.\n\nWhat kind of jeepneys do students like to ride in? Copy the correct answer from the words below.\nRed jeepneys\nGreen jeepneys\nBlue jeepneys\nJeepneys with stereo sets\n\nCopy the word that tells what some jeepneys have.\nTelevision\nstereo sets\nRefrigerator\n\nWrite one word that tells what the story is about. Underline the word.',NULL,'[]','Read the story carefully, then answer the questions.\n\nJeepneys\nJeepneys are fast rides. There are many of them in the century. Jeepneys come in different colors. There are blue, yellow, green and red jeepneys. There are also multicolored ones.\n\nSome jeepneys have stereo sets. There are those with brightly colored curtains. Students who go to school like to ride in curtained jeepneys with stereos.\n\nCopy the sentence that tells what kind of rides jeepneys are.\n\nCopy the different colors of jeepneys.\n\nWhat kind of jeepneys do students like to ride in? Copy the correct answer from the words below.\nRed jeepneys\nGreen jeepneys\nBlue jeepneys\nJeepneys with stereo sets\n\nCopy the word that tells what some jeepneys have.\nTelevision\nstereo sets\nRefrigerator\n\nWrite one word that tells what the story is about. Underline the word.',NULL,10,51,'Read the story carefully, then answer the questions.\n\nJeepneys\nJeepneys are fast rides. There are many of them in the century. Jeepneys come in different colors. There are b