(1212,492,NULL,'learn',1,'The First Monkey','open','Read the story carefully, then answer the questions.','Read the story carefully, then answer the questions.\n\nThe First Monkey\nA long time ago, there was a farmer who had a wide corn field. He grew big and sweet corn. One day, he saw some of his corn was gone. Many corn plants had no more ears. He wanted to catch whoever was stealing his corn.\n\nThe next day, he hid behind a big mango tree. He carried a stick. He watched carefully until he saw a man coming. The man passed through a broken part of the fence and began to pick some corn. The farmer came out from behind the mango tree and walked toward the man. When the man saw the farmer, he started to run. The farmer ran after him but he could not catch him. Then he threw the stick at the man’s back, and it became a tail. The man went up the tree. He became smaller and smaller until he became a monkey.\n\nWhen did the story happen?\na. Last year\nb. A few years ago\nc. a long time ago\n\nWhat did the farmer have?\na. A rice field\nb. A camote field\nc. a corn field\n\nWhat words will tell about his corn?\na. big and sweet\nb. small and sweet\nc. sweet and yellow\n\nWhat happened to his corn?\na. were stolen\nb. destroyed by insects\nc. destroyed by the wind\n\nWhere did the farmer hide one day?\na. up the mango tree\nb. behind the guava tree\nc. behind the mango tree\n\nWhat did he carry?\na. a stick\nb. some fruits\nc. some stones\n\nWho did he see come into the corn field?\na. a dog\nb. a man\nc. a Monkey\n\nWhat did the farmer do to the man?\na. caught him\nb. threw the stick at him\nc. beat him with the stick\n\nWhat happened to the stick?\na. was lost\nb. was broken\nc. became a tail\n\nWhat happened to the man?\na. became sick\nb. became a monkey\nc. became a corn plant',NULL,'[]','Read the story carefully, then answer the questions.\n\nThe First Monkey\nA long time ago, there was a farmer who had a wide corn field. He grew big and sweet corn. One day, he sa