(1255,535,NULL,'learn',1,'True or False','open','Directions: Write True if the statement is correct, False if it is incorrect.','Directions: Write True if the statement is correct, False if it is incorrect.\n\nHaving a school newspaper empowers students to showcase their writing skills and voice their opinions.\nTrue\nFalse\n\nPupil-run newspapers are great way to build communication between all groups in the school.\nTrue\nFalse\n\nThe purpose of newsletter is to provide information to parents only.\nTrue\nFalse\n\nBrainstorming and producing a school newspaper can provide pupils with valuable experience in collaboration and teamwork.\nTrue\nFalse\n\nCampus newsletter helps pupils build confidence.\nTrue\nFalse\n\nNews found in the campus newsletter are just copied from well-known newspapers in the country.\nTrue\nFalse\n\nCampus newsletter may not publish national and local news.\nTrue\nFalse\n\nPupils can express their thoughts and ideas in school newsletter.\nTrue\nFalse\n\nCampus newsletter strengthens the relationship of the school and community.\nTrue\nFalse\n\nPupils are trained to manage school paper guided by school newsletter advisers.\nTrue\nFalse',NULL,'[]','Directions: Write True if the statement is correct, False if it is incorrect.\n\nHaving a school newspaper empowers students to showcase their writing skills and voice their opinions.\nTrue\nFalse\n\nPupil-run newspapers are great way to build communication between all groups in the school.\nTrue\nFalse\n\nThe purpose of newsletter is to provide information to parents only.\nTrue\nFalse\n\nBrainstorming and producing a school newspaper can provide pupils with valuable experience in collaboration and teamwork.\nTrue\nFalse\n\nCampus newsletter helps pupils build confidence.\nTrue\nFalse\n\nNews found in the campus newsletter are just copied from well-known newspapers in the country.\nTrue\nFalse\n\nCampus newsletter may not publish national and local news.\nTrue\nFalse\n\nPupils can express their thoughts and ideas in school newsletter.\nTrue\nFalse\n\nCampus newsletter strengthens the relationship of the school and community.\nTrue\nFalse\n\nPupils are trained to manage school paper guided by school newsletter advisers.\nTrue\nFalse',NULL,10,6,'Directions: Write True if the statement is correct, False if it is incorrect.\n\nHaving a school newspaper empowers students to showcase their writing skills and voice their opinions.\nTrue\nFalse\n\nPupil-run newspapers are great way to build communication between all groups in the school.\nTrue\nFalse\n\nThe purpose of newsletter is to provide information to parents only.\nTrue\nFalse\n\nBrainstorming and producing a school newspaper can provide pupils with valuable experience in collaboration and teamwork.\nTrue\nFalse\n\nCampus newsletter helps pupils build confidence.\nTrue\nFalse\n\nNews found in the campus newsletter are just copied from well-known newspapers in the country.\nTrue\nFalse\n\nCampus newsletter may not publish national and local news.\nTrue\nFalse\n\nPupils can express their thoughts and ideas in school newsletter.\nTrue\nFalse\n\nCampus newsletter strengthens the relationship of the school and community.\nTrue\nFalse\n\nPupils are trained to manage school paper guided by school newsletter advisers.\nTrue\nFalse',1,1,'answer'),
(1256,536,NULL,'learn',1,'Star or Circle','open','Directions: Read the sentences carefully. If the statement implies importance to pupils/students, draw a star (★). If it implies importance to the school/community, draw a circle (●).','Directions: Read the sentences carefully. If the statement implies importance to pupils/students, draw a star (★). If it implies importance to the school/community, draw a circle (●).\n\nCampus newsletter develops qualities of cooperation, tact, accuracy, tolerance, responsibility and leadership.\n★ Star – pupils/students\n● Circle – school/community\n\nPublish school and community news.\n★ Star – pupils/students\n● Circle – school/community\n\nProvides an opportunity for interesting writing.\n★ Star – pupils/students\n● Circle – school/community\n\nEncourages and stimulates worthwhile activities.\n★ Star – pupils/students\n● Circle – school/community\n\nMake known the achievements of the school.\n★ Star – pupils/students\n● Circle – school/community',NULL,'[]','Directions: Read the sentences carefully. If the statement implies importance to pupils/students, draw a star (★). If it implies importance to the school/community, draw a circle (●).\n\nCampus newsletter develops qualities of cooperation, tact, accuracy, tolerance, responsibility and leadership.\n★ Star – pupils/students\n● Circle – school/community\n\nPublish school and community news.\n★ Star – pupils/students\n● Circle – school/community\n\nProvides an opportunity for interesting writing.\n★ Star – pupils/students\n● Circle – school/community\n\nEncourages and stimulates worthwhile activities.\n★ Star – pupils/students\n● Circle – school/community\n\nMake known the achievements of the school.\n★ Star – pupils/students\n● Circle – school/community',NULL,10,7,'Directions: Read the sentences carefully. If the statement implies importance to pupils/students, draw a star (★). If it implies importance to the school/community, draw a circle (●).\n\nCampus newsletter develops qualities of cooperation, tact, accuracy, tolerance, responsibility and leadership.\n★ Star – pupils/students\n● Circle – school/community\n\nPublish school and community news.\n★ Star – pupils/students\n● Circle – school/community\n\nProvides an opportunity for interesting writing.\n★ Star – pupils/students\n● Circle – school/community\n\nEncourages and stimulates worthwhile activities.\n★ Star – pupils/students\n● Circle – school/community\n\nMake known the achievements of the school.\n★ Star – pupils/students\n● Circle – school/community',1,1,'answer'),
(1257,537,NULL,'learn',1,'Writing Campus Newsletter','open','Directions: Based on the diagram below, choose 3 words and explain how it is related to the topic: Importance of campus newsletter in the school and community.','Directions: Based on the diagram below, choose 3 words and explain how it is related to the topic: Importance of campus newsletter in the school and community.\n\nImportance of Campus Newsletter\n\nFirst word you chose: write the word and explain how it is related to the importance of the campus newsletter.\n\nSecond word you chose: write the word and explain how it is related to the importance of the campus newsletter.\n\nThird word you chose: write the word and explain how it is related to the importance of the campus newsletter.','assets/images/level7/g3/p008-1.webp','[\"assets/images/level7/g3/p008-1.webp\"]','Directions: Based on the diagram below, choose 3 words and explain how it is related to the topic: Importance of campus newsletter in the school and community.\n\nImportance of Campus Newsletter\n\nFirst word you chose: write the word and explain how it is related to the importance of the campus newsletter.\n\nSecond word you chose: write the word and explain how it is related to the importance of the campus newsletter.\n\nThird word you chose: write the word and explain how it is related to the importance of the campus newsletter.',NULL,10,8,'Directions: Based on the diagram below, choose 3 words and explain how it is related to the topic: Importance of campus newsletter in the school and community.\n\nImportance of Campus Newsletter\n\nFirst word you chose: write the word and explain how it is related to the importance of the campus newsletter.\n\nSecond word you chose: write the word and explain how it is related to the importance of the campus newsletter.\n\nThird word you chose: write the word and explain how it is related to the importance of the campus newsletter.',1,1,'answer'),
