heet individually.\n\nPDF page 154\nIV. Evaluation:\n\nPart A: Picture Match (Formative)\n\n  *Listen to your teacher say the word in parts. Blend the syllables to make a word.\nCircle the matching picture.*\n\n\n\n  1. Teacher says: \"can... dy\"\n\n    Options: 🍬 (candy) 🐕 (dog) 📘 (book)\n\n\n\n  2. Teacher says: \"tel... e... phone\"\n\n    Options: 🐘 (elephant) 📞 (telephone) 🌮 (taco)\n\n\n\n  3. Teacher says: \"win... dow\"\n\n    Options: � (window) 💨 (wind) 🏮 (lantern)\n\n\n\n  **Part B: Create a Word & Illustrate (Summative)**\n\n  *Blend the syllables to discover a secret word. Draw it in the box!*\n\n\n\n  1. \"sand... witch\" = ____________\n\n    📦 (Box for drawing a sandwich)\n\n\n\n  2. \"but... ter... fly\" = ____________\n\n    📦 (Box for drawing a butterfly)','[43, 147, 148, 149, 150, 151, 152, 153, 154]','assets/images/level2b/page-043.webp',1,'2026-11-15 11:14:44'),
