(199,12,22220,'Activity 20','Famous Locations','Listen, learn and use new words about famous locations.','Listening Comprehension and Vocabulary Development · Level 5 · Grade 2\nFamous Locations · module PDF pages 60, 61, 62\n\nPupils see each module page with its text and pictures. Listen reads the page aloud; for listening items read the passage yourself if you prefer. Pupils type or say their numbered answers; check them with the answer key below and give feedback.\n\nPDF page 60\nLesson 20- Famous Location\nFamous Location\nWhere there is water, life is better.\nWhere there is greenness, air is fresh.\nRelax and refresh, Keep away from stress.\nBulkang Mayon\nBoracay Island\nBanaue Rice\nTerraces\nCoron Reef\nMaria Cristina\nDakak Beach\nFalls\nSohoton Cave\nPagsangjan\nHundred Islands\nFalls\n\nPDF page 61\nPART A — VOCABULARY WITH PICTURES\nDirections: Match the picture to the correct word. Write the letter of the\ncorrect answer.\nPicture Icons :\ns‘\n<‘.- – Boracay Island\nh – Banaue Rice Terraces ˜u\n˙ – Bulkang Mayon L\ny\n˘ ·k – Coron Reef χ – Maria Cristina Falls Içˇ*\n³ ‘\n«_ – Dakak Beach\n˙\n⬛\n˙\nx¿ –\nÇ, – Hundred Islands\nPagsanjan Falls . – Sohoton Cave ’˜\n1. Items:\nWord List:\nh‘s y ______\n2. y\nA. Bulkang Mayon\nu ˜\nu ˙ ˙ ______\n3. ˙\nB. Banaue Rice Terraces\nL‘\n4. .-\n.- < ______\nC. Maria Cristina Falls\n5. ˘·\nk ˙ ______\n˙\nD. Dakak Beach\n6. χ ______\nE. Pagsanjan Falls\n7. Içˇ*\n«_ ______\nF. Sohoton Cave\n˙³ ‘x¿ ______\n8. ⬛\nG. Hundred Islands\n9.. ______\nH. Coron Reef\nÇ, ’˜ ______\n10. ’˜\nI. Boracay Island\nPART B — LISTENING COMPREHENSION\nTeacher reads the short story aloud. Story: Famous Location\nWhere there is water, life is better. Where there is greenness, air is fresh. Relax\nand refresh, Keep away from stress.\nDirections: Listen carefully to the story and answer the questions.\n1. What makes life better according to the story?\na. Water\nb. Cars\nc. Mountains\n2. What makes the air fresh?\na. Greenness\nb. Buildings\n