(204,13,3202,'Activity 2','The Magical Tree House Adventure','Listen, learn and use new words about the magical tree house adventure.','Listening Comprehension and Vocabulary Development · Level 5 · Grade 3\nThe Magical Tree House Adventure · module PDF page 23\n\nPupils see each module page with its text and pictures. Listen reads the page aloud; for listening items read the passage yourself if you prefer. Pupils type or say their numbered answers; check them with the answer key below and give feedback.\n\nPDF page 23\nActivity 2:\n\"The Magical Tree house Adventure\"\nJack and Annie climbed into their magical tree house. Today, the tree\nhouse took them to a tropical rainforest.\nThey saw colorful birds, heard monkeys\nchattering,\nand\ndiscovered\na\nhidden\nwaterfall. They learned about different\ntypes of plants and animals that live in the\nrainforest habitat.\nQuestions:\n1. Where did the magical tree house take Jack and Annie?\na) to the desert\nb) to the mountains\nc) to a tropical rainforest\nd) to the beach\n2. What did they hear in the rainforest?\na) lions roaring\nb) monkeys chattering\nc) wolves howling\nd) elephants trumpeting\n3. What is the word for the place where plants and animals live?\na) city\nb) habitat\nc) school\nd) house\n\nANSWER KEY (teacher only)\n\nPDF page 13\nPAGE  \\* MERGEFORMAT 1 \nANSWER KEY \n1. B \n2. C \n3. C \n4. C \n5. B \n6. B \n7. B \n8. B \n9. B \n10. B \n11. D \n12. C \n13. C \n14. B \n15. B \n16. C \n17. A \n18. A \n19. B \n20. C \n21. B \n22. C \n23. B \n24. A \n25. C \n26. A \n27. B \n28. B \n29. C \n30. C \n31. B \n32. A \n33. B \n34. A \n35. B \n36. A \n37. C \n38. B \n39. A \n40. B \n41. A\n42. B \n43. A \n44. B \n45. B \n46. C \n47. A \n48. B \n49. A \n50. C\nPDF page 43\nPAGE  \\* MERGEFORMAT 20 \nAnswer Keys \nActivity 1: \n1. b \n2. c \n3. c \n \nActivity 2: \n1. c \n2. b \n3. b \n \nActivity 3: \n1. b \n2. b \n3. b \n \nActivity 4: \n1. b \n2. d \n3. c \n \nActivity 5: \n1.c \n2.b \n3.b \n \nActivity 6: Set A