(210,13,9209,'Activity 9','A Gift from Uncle','Listen, learn and use new words about a gift from uncle.','Listening Comprehension and Vocabulary Development · Level 5 · Grade 3\nA Gift from Uncle · module PDF page 30\n\nPupils see each module page with its text and pictures. Listen reads the page aloud; for listening items read the passage yourself if you prefer. Pupils type or say their numbered answers; check them with the answer key below and give feedback.\n\nPDF page 30\nActivity\n9: Set B\nA GIFT FROM UNCLE\nDo you have an uncle living far away?\nMiriam has. His name is Max. Miriam calls him\nUncle Max. He lives in New York.\nLast Christmas, Uncle Max sent Miriam a gift. It\ncame in a big heavy box. Father helped open the\nbox.\nThen they saw something very pretty. It was a big doll. It had round\nblue eyes and a small red mouth. It had a blue lace dress and curly black\nhair. Miriam called it Curly. She loved to play with it. What Miriam liked\nbest was the way Curly walked. Miriam would hold one of its hands and\nthey would walk together around the living room. Curly made Miriam\nhappy.\n1. Who was Curly?\na. a dog\nb. a doll\nc. a cat\n2. Who gave Curly to Miriam?\na. Father\nb. Mother\nc. Uncle Max\n3. Where does Uncle Max live?\na. Cebu\nb. Manila\nc. New York\n4. On what occasion was Curly given?\na. birthday\nb. Christmas c. graduation\n5. Who helped Miriam open the box?\na. Father\nb. Mother\nc. Uncle Max\n6. What words talk about the box?\na. big and light\nb. big and heavy\nc. small and light\n7. What words talk about Curly’s mouth?\na. red\nb. pink\nc. yellow\n8. What was Curly’s dress made of?\na. silk\nb. lace\nc. cotton\n9. What word talks about her hair?\na. curly\nb. brown\nc. straight\n10. What can Curly do?\na. talk\nb. sing c. walk\n\nANSWER KEY (teacher only)\n\nPDF page 13\nPAGE  \\* MERGEFORMAT 1 \nANSWER KEY \n1. B \n2. C \n3. C \n4. C \n5. B \n6. B \n7. B \n8. B \n9. B \n10. B \n11. D \n12. C \n13. C \n14. B \n15. B \n16. C \n17. A \n18