(211,13,10210,'Activity 10','Taking Care of Animals','Listen, learn and use new words about taking care of animals.','Listening Comprehension and Vocabulary Development · Level 5 · Grade 3\nTaking Care of Animals · module PDF page 31\n\nPupils see each module page with its text and pictures. Listen reads the page aloud; for listening items read the passage yourself if you prefer. Pupils type or say their numbered answers; check them with the answer key below and give feedback.\n\nPDF page 31\nActivity 10:\nSet A\nTAKING CARE OF ANIMALS\nVictor lives on a farm. He lives with his parents\nin a little nipa house. Victor has an elder sister\nnamed Nora. Victor and Nora help their parents.\nThey help take care of their animals. They have a\ncarabao, a horse, a goat, and some chickens.\nFather takes care of the horse. Victor takes care\nof the carabao. Mother takes care of the chickens.\nNora takes care of the\ngoat. Their animals are all fat and healthy. Each one takes care of their animal\nvery well.\n1. Where does Victor live?\na. in the city\nb. on a farm\nc. near the sea\n2. Which word tells about their house?\na. nipa\nb. cement\nc. wooden\n3. Who is Victor’s sister?\na. Nina\nb. Nora\nc. Nida\n4. Who is older, Victor or Nora?\na. Nora\nb. Victor\nc. Does not tell\n5. How many kinds of animals do they have?\na. 3\nb. 4.\nc.5\n6. Which one they do not have?\na. cow\nb. horse\nc. carabao\n7. Who takes care of the horse?\na. Victor\nb. Father\nc. Mother\n8. Who takes care of the carabao?\na. Nora\nb. Victor\nc. Father\n9. Who takes care of the chickens?\na. Nora\nb. Victor\nc. Mother\n10. Which one does Nora take care of?\na. goat\nb. chickens\nc. carabao\n\nANSWER KEY (teacher only)\n\nPDF page 13\nPAGE  \\* MERGEFORMAT 1 \nANSWER KEY \n1. B \n2. C \n3. C \n4. C \n5. B \n6. B \n7. B \n8. B \n9. B \n10. B \n11. D \n12. C \n13. C \n14. B \n15. B \n16. C \n17. A \n18. A \n19. B \n20. C \n21. B \n22. C \n23. B \n24. A \n25. C \n26. A \n27. B \n28. B \n29. C \n30. C \n31. 