(296,16,7206,'Activity 6','Link the Letters','Listen, learn and use new words about link the letters.','Listening Comprehension and Vocabulary Development · Level 5 · Grade 6\nLink the Letters · module PDF page 15\n\nPupils see each module page with its text and pictures. Listen reads the page aloud; for listening items read the passage yourself if you prefer. Pupils type or say their numbered answers; check them with the answer key below and give feedback.\n\nPDF page 15\nLink the Letters\nActivity 6\nDirections: For each box, a letter grid is presented. Locate the words\nwithin the grid and draw a line from square to square to link the letters to\nform the words. Use the definition of words below as clues.\nn\nu\nl\nA\na\nb\nu\na\ns\no\na\nt\nT\ns\na\nc\nt\nn\nt\nY\na\ne\nb\ns\nt\nn\ne\nP\ne\no\nn\no\nwith care and\nnature, kind\nan act, a thing done\nthoughtfulness\ne\nw\no\nB\na\ns\no\na\ne\ne\ne\nm\nA\nn\nt\ne\ns\np\nt\ns\ne\nL\nm\nt\nn\nu\ne\nd\ne\nn\nM\ne\na\ns\na\nc\nFlesh of an animal\ndirection sunset\nconsumed as\nreason, root\n______ ______ food ______ ______\ne\ng\nn\no\ng\nb\nd\ne\na\ns\no\ny\ne\nu\na\nl\no\nn\ng\nn\nd\nd\nd\na\nl\nf\ng\no\no\ns\nd\naffection from\nafar, out there\ncontract\nheart ______ ______\ne\no\nr\np\na\ns\na\nn\ns\nd\no\no\n______ permit ______\npass\ndeal\nbeyond\nlove\ncause\nmeat\nwest\naction\ntype\nattention\n\nThe module has no answer key for this grade.','[15]',NULL,1,'2026-11-15 11:14:45'),
