(300,16,11210,'Activity 10','Prep Paired','Listen, learn and use new words about prep paired.','Listening Comprehension and Vocabulary Development · Level 5 · Grade 6\nPrep Paired · module PDF page 19\n\nPupils see each module page with its text and pictures. Listen reads the page aloud; for listening items read the passage yourself if you prefer. Pupils type or say their numbered answers; check them with the answer key below and give feedback.\n\nPDF page 19\nPrep Paired\nActivity 10\nDirections: Complete the words by choosing your answer from the words\ninside the box. Complete the sentences using the words from the word\nbank that make it correct. The signal letter/s were given.\nperhaps\nready\nmembers\npaint\nrain\nblue\nwindow\nbill\nWord\nmatter\ndirection anything\nmind\nbank\nexercise\nreturn\nwish\ncount\n______ difference\nenergy\n1. There is a mirror _ e_ _ _ in the sink.\n2. Airplanes flew over the b_ _ _ sky above us.\n3. The event happened a long time in my m _ _ _.\n4. I _ i s _ I can go to bed early.\n5. The boy runs as his e _ _ r _ i _ _ _ .\n6. She saw his mother has lack of e _ _ _ gy.\n7. The sun rises in the east _ _ r e c _ _ on.\n8. He sit with his group _ _ mb _ ______.\n9. Mother p_ _ _t the table in the room.\n10.\nThe ducks’ bi _ _ is big.\n11.\nThe teacher p _ _ h _ ps got angry.\n12.\nShe plays under the heavy r _ _ n.\n13.\nThe door and w _ _ d _ w are open.\n14.\nPlease follow the test d_ _ e c _ _ _ n.\n15.\nIs there a _ _th_ _ _ I can do?\n16.\nThe d_ _fer_ _ _ce of 8 and 2 is 6.\n17.\nI _ _ sh I pass the test.\n18.\nKindly c_ _ _ t numbers 1 to 100.\n\nThe module has no answer key for this grade.','[19]',NULL,1,'2026-11-15 11:14:45'),
(301,16,12211,'Activity 11','Fill in the Blank','Listen, learn and use new words about fill in the blank.','Listening Comprehension and Vocabulary Development · Level 5 · Grade 6\nFill in the Blank · module PDF page 20\n\nPupils see each module page with its text and pictures. Listen reads the page aloud; for listening items read the passage yourself if you prefer. Pupils type or say their numbered answers; check them with the answer key below and give feedback.\n\nPDF page 20\nFill in the blank\nActivity 11\nDirections: Complete the sentences below by choosing the correct\nwords inside the box. Answer the worksheet activity by filling in the blank.\nsum\nsummer\nwall\nprobably\nmain\nwinter\nwide\nwritten\nlength\nreason\nkept\ninterest\npresent beautiful\nability\npart ______ ______\n1. May is a month of ______\n.\n2. The duck has a big ______\n.\n3. The chicken’s body has 1-inch ______\nof measure.\n4. I have ten ______\nin my hands.\n5. The color of the ______\nis black.\n6. The body covering of frog is ______\nsmooth.\n7. Mother doesn’t like a ______\nseason.\n8. A baby has the ______\nto twinkle his eyes.\n9. My two feet have the ______\nthat I cannot walk far.\n10.\nA limp dog ______\non barking.\n11.\nMy name was ______\nin the list.\n12.\nThe cow’s ______\nears have a wound.\n13.\nBaba has a ______\nflower garden.\n14.\nThe boy has a ______\nin the drama activity.\n15.\nI bought a ______\nfor mothers’ day.\n16.\nThe ______\nreason that I was absent was because I have\nfever.\n\nThe module has no answer key for this grade.','[20]',NULL,1,'2026-11-15 11:14:45'),
