(327,17,16215,'Activity 15','Good Ways','Cause and Effect: read the story and answer the questions.','Graded Reading Comprehension · Level 6 · Grade 1\nActivity 15: Good Ways · skill: Cause and Effect · module PDF page 24\n\nPupils read the story on its own card (Listen reads it aloud), then answer one question per card. Choices, Reality/Fantasy, ordering of events and cause-and-effect matching follow the module. Speed-reading stories have a timer that records the reading time and words per minute.\n\nGood Ways (PDF page 24)\nDirection: Read the story. Draw a line to match each cause on the left with its effect on the right.\n\nGood Ways\nOne Sunday, Lino went to the garden to check the vegetables he planted.\nWhile walking fast, a branch hit his forehead.\nHe picked malunggay leaves, crushed them, and rubbed them on his forehead.\nHe continued gathering vegetables to bring them home.\nHe cooked them to have a delicious viand.\n\nColumn A\n1. Lino went to the garden.\n2. He picked malunggay leaves\n3. Lino cooked the vegetables\n4. He was walking fast\n5. To be able to bring home some vegetables\nA. so they had a delicious viand.\nB. when a branch hit his head.\nC. and rubbed it on his forehead\nD. he gathered it.\nE. to check the vegetables.\n\nANSWER KEY (teacher only)\n\nPDF page 36\n31 \nAnswer Key \nPretest \nMy Friend \n1. B \n2. C \n3. A \n4. A \n5. B \nThe Farmer \n1. B \n2. C \n3. A \n4. B \n5. B \nMy Dolly \n1. B \n2. A \n3. B \n4. B \n5. B \nJoy’s Aya \n1. C \n2. A \n3. A \n4. B \n5. B \nLita the Cow \n1. R \n2. F \n3. F \n4. R \n5. R \nRosa’s Goat \n1. R \n2. F \n3. R \n4. F \n5. R \nBenny’s Happy Day \n1. R \n2. F \n3. F \n4. R \n5. R \nLily’s Magical Pet \n1. R \n2. R \n3. R \n4. F \n5. F \nA Cold Bear \n1. _3  Bear finds a den. \n2.  2  Bear eats a lot. \n3.  5  Bear eats even more. \n4.  4  Bear fills the den with leaves, so \nhe will stay warm. \n5.  1  Bear needs to get ready for winter. \nDessert Time \n1. 3  Jan gets some cake. \n2.  2 Tim gets a