(868,868,'Crosswords\nActivity 8\nDirections:\n1. Find the words inside the crossword puzzle.\n2. Use color pen or crayons to answer. Word clues are provided inside\nthe box below.\n1. listen – use ears to hear the\n7. learn – understand\n8. quite – no sound\nwords or sound\n2. nap- sleep\n9. kiss – a smack on the cheek\n3. shut- close\n10. knock- someone at the door\n4. slip- slide\n11. send – something to give in distance\n12. shake - handshake\n5. slow- not fast\n6. mark – write ______\nlisten nap\nshut slip\nshine slow mark\nlearn quite kiss knock\nsend shake ______\nflew\nhid\nbit\ndead\nshook\nseen\nsent\nfought grew\nkept\nhung\nfelt','teacher'),
