(956,956,'Fill in the blank\nActivity 11\nDirections: Complete the sentences below by choosing the correct\nwords inside the box. Answer the worksheet activity by filling in the blank.\nsum\nsummer\nwall\nprobably\nmain\nwinter\nwide\nwritten\nlength\nreason\nkept\ninterest\npresent beautiful\nability\npart ______ ______\n1. May is a month of ______\n.\n2. The duck has a big ______\n.\n3. The chicken’s body has 1-inch ______\nof measure.\n4. I have ten ______\nin my hands.\n5. The color of the ______\nis black.\n6. The body covering of frog is ______\nsmooth.\n7. Mother doesn’t like a ______\nseason.\n8. A baby has the ______\nto twinkle his eyes.\n9. My two feet have the ______\nthat I cannot walk far.\n10.\nA limp dog ______\non barking.\n11.\nMy name was ______\nin the list.\n12.\nThe cow’s ______\nears have a wound.\n13.\nBaba has a ______\nflower garden.\n14.\nThe boy has a ______\nin the drama activity.\n15.\nI bought a ______\nfor mothers’ day.\n16.\nThe ______\nreason that I was absent was because I have\nfever.','teacher'),
